    mc "放松点。你没被强奸。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1662
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_4b17223e:

    # de "Then why do I wanna curl up in the shower and scald my body with hot water?"
    de "那我为什么想缩在淋浴间里，让热水烫遍全身？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1664
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_fdff06e6:

    # mc "Because you're overly dramatic at times."
    mc "因为你有时候太夸张了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1666
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_ecd410ca:

    # mc "Yeah, I get that feeling. I feel sorry for you."
    mc "嗯，我懂这种感觉。真替你难过。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1668
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_126485c8:

    # de "You don't get this feeling at all."
    de "你根本体会不到这种感觉。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1670
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_40c80f12:

    # mc "You saw me on that poster, too, didn't you?"
    mc "你也看到了那张海报上的我，对吧？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1671
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_479a7cb5:

    # mc "I don't think you're the only one at college named Derek, and at least you're wearing a mask."
    mc "学校里叫Derek的肯定不止你一个，而且照片里至少还戴着面具。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1673
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_f0660dd9:

    # de "It said we were DIKs, too. People will know it's me."
    de "它上面也写着我们也是DIKs。人们会认出那是我。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1675
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_8abe7b74:

    # mc "Oh, yeah... But try to stay positive."
    mc "哦，是啊……但试着保持积极点。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1677
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_6720d562:

    # mc "The picture wasn't that bad. It didn't show your face; someone assumed it was you."
    mc "那张照片其实也没那么糟糕。它没拍到你的脸，有人以为那是你。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1679
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_2a231c54:

    # de "They assumed correctly..."
    de "他们猜对了……"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1681
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_fa3777c7:

    # mc "Still, it's an assumption."
    mc "不过，这毕竟只是个假设。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1684
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_bc499115:

    # de "It's easy for you to say. They didn't write your name next to your cock. Not that it would do you anything bad if they did."
    de "对你来说说起来容易。他们没在你那玩意儿旁边写上你的名字。不过要是他们写了，对你也未必是坏事。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1685
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_dc5ddd45:

    # de "They'd probably have a parade for the monument they built out of it."
    de "他们大概会为那座用它建的纪念碑搞个游行。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1686
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_99c87e7d:

    # de "Couldn't they have assumed that I was the one with the big one?"
    de "他们就不能假设是我那个大的吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1688
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_3050337f:

    # mc "My comment wasn't that flattering either... I mean...I can grow body hair."
    mc "我的评论也不太好听……我是说……我也可以长毛。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1689
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_7e067688:

    # mc "But haven't we learned something from what happened to Cathy?"
    mc "但Cathy那件事还没让我们吸取教训吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1690
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_1ad7c6f7:

    # mc "Someone tried to make her look bad and it bullied her into quitting."
    mc "有人想让她难堪，逼她退学。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1691
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_08bce346:

    # mc "And now, someone is trying to do the same with us for some reason."
    mc "现在有人想对我们做同样的事，不知道为什么。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1693
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_84fc107f:

    # de "Wait a minute... Do you think it's the same person doing it? It could be, right?"
    de "等等……你是不是觉得是同一个人在搞鬼？说不定就是他，对吧？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1697
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_95096f73:

    # mc "The method is similar, but anyone can put up a poster."
    mc "方法类似，但任何人都能贴个海报。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1699
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_a35d3779:

    # de "But only someone who was in our mansion could have gotten those pictures. They're on our wall."
    de "但只有住在我们宅子里的人才能拿到那些照片。它们贴在我们墙上。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1701
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_593b3168:

    # mc "True. But many have been, so it doesn't narrow it down by a lot."
    mc "确实。但很多人都这么干过，所以也没法缩小范围太多。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1703
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_70796479:

    # mc "Why would it be the same person?"
    mc "为什么是同一个人？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1705
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_9a7fc4ba:

    # de "Because it's happened two times now and both have been targeting us somehow."
    de "因为已经发生了两次，而且两次都是在针对我们。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1706
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_80d1869b:

    # de "And only someone who was in our mansion could have gotten those pictures. They're on our wall and Cathy's picture was posted from our computer."
    de "而且只有进过豪宅的人才能拿到那些照片。它们都在我们的墙上，Cathy的照片也是用我们的电脑发出去的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1708
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_cd4d2060:

    # mc "True. But a lot of people have been to our mansion, so it doesn't narrow it down by a lot."
    mc "真没错。但很多人去过我们的宅邸，所以也没法缩小范围太多。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1710
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_b1fc2001:

    # de "It must be someone from the Halloween party. I can feel it in my gut."
    de "这一定是万圣节派对上的人。我感觉到了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1712
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_b0759f4c:

    # de "First, someone makes dirty movies of me in my room, and now my average-sized penis is put on display and called small to everyone on campus."
    de "首先有人在我房间里拍了我做那种事的视频，现在我的普通尺寸的阴茎被摆出来，全校的人都叫它小。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1713
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_cfacc7f7:

    # de "Why is this happening to me?"
    de "为什么偏偏是我？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1715
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_349da5c4:

    # mc "We'll bounce back from this, bro."
    mc "我们能挺过去的，兄弟。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1717
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_a0585d67:

    # te5 "Welcome to Introduction to Science - Applied Chemistry In Theory & Practice."
    te5 "欢迎来到科学导论——理论与实践中的应用化学。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1718
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_66941b12:

    # te5 "I can see that the class consists of freshman and older students. That's nice."
    te5 "我能看出来这节课的学生有新生也有年纪更大的人。这挺好的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1719
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_9437a8ec:

    # te5 "For those of you who don't know me, I am Professor Willcock."
    te5 "对于那些还不知道我的人，我叫威尔科克教授。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1721
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_747b2dfc:

    # de "Haha! Cock."
    de "哈哈！操。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1722
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_a560c3c7:

    # mc "Haha... Grow up."
    mc "哈哈... 长大点。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1724
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_68326640:

    # te5 "I will be your teacher for the theoretical portion of this course."
    te5 "我会负责这门课程的理论部分教学。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1725
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_9625a7f5:

    # te5 "That means that it's me who you want to impress to get a higher grade."
    te5 "这意味着你们想讨好我才能拿到高分。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1726
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_12a9eea4:

    # te5 "Haha, I'm kidding. But I am the one grading your papers, so it's not all a joke."
    te5 "哈哈，我开个玩笑啦。不过我可是给你们打分的人，所以这可不是什么好笑的事。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1728
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_e8a84b57:

    # te5 "While I will teach you the basics of the chemistry you should master at a university level, Dr. Jenkins will be in charge of the lab work."
    te5 "虽然我会教你大学水平化学的基础知识，但实验室部分将由詹金斯博士负责。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1729
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_00e26f68:

    # te5 "The lab portion will focus on developing your skills in calculations, measuring and various forms of analysis."
    te5 "实验室部分将重点培养你们在计算、测量以及各种分析方法上的技能。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1730
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_1d3c4c07:

    # te5 "Since the class is too big for the lab, we will split the class into two groups. Make sure you sign up for one of the groups before you leave today."
    te5 "因为班级太大，实验室的容量不够，所以我们要把全班分成两个小组。记得在今天离开前，务必报名加入其中一个小组。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1732
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_22d2e13c:

    # te5 "These lectures will primarily be me up here teaching you the theory. Make notes - a lot of them - and ask questions when you have one. Please don't be shy to interrupt me."
    te5 "这些课我主要是在这儿给你们讲理论，记笔记——记很多笔记——有问题就问，有疑问就打断我。别害羞。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1734
translate schinese ep10_science_intro_label_e087eb46:

    # te5 "Today, we will start with atom orbitals. Fascinating stuff!"
    te5 "今天，我们先来谈谈原子轨道。挺有意思的！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1749
translate schinese ep10_ipb_label_5da3bc21:

    # ph "Good afternoon, Mrs. Roberts."
    ph "下午好，罗伯茨女士。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1751
translate schinese ep10_ipb_label_32e479d4:

    # isa "Professor Hoff."
    isa "教授霍夫。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1754
translate schinese ep10_ipb_label_2e03284c:

    # ph "I have parsed the test at your request."
    ph "我按你的要求分析了试卷。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1756
translate schinese ep10_ipb_label_6703a01f:

    # ph "I have parsed the tests at your request."
    ph "我已经按你的要求解析了试卷。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1758
translate schinese ep10_ipb_label_67832a40:

    # isa "Oh, thank you. Did you find anything?"
    isa "哦，谢谢。你发现什么了吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1762
translate schinese ep10_ipb_label_d4f87631:

    # ph "I'm afraid I have to disappoint you. There is nothing that suggests the student in question had cheated."
    ph "恐怕我得让您失望了。目前没有任何证据表明这名学生作弊了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1763
translate schinese ep10_ipb_label_e731b0ac:

    # ph "In fact, he or she didn't do well on the test. It's passable but below average."
    ph "事实上，他或她在这次考试中表现并不好。勉强及格，但低于平均水平。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1765
translate schinese ep10_ipb_label_d4f5e4e9:

    # isa "I see..."
    isa "我明白了……"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1767
translate schinese ep10_ipb_label_cf884286:

    # ph "But the lack of evidence on my end doesn't mean that your findings are for naught."
    ph "但在我这边缺乏证据，并不意味着你的发现就毫无意义。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1769
translate schinese ep10_ipb_label_3a5c04fe:

    # isa "No, I know. I was hoping to support my theory with your help. Now, I don't know what to do with it."
    isa "不，我知道。我原本希望借助你的帮助来支持我的理论。现在，我都不知道该怎么办了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1771
translate schinese ep10_ipb_label_53baceea:

    # ph "If you want my professional advice, I'd tell you to correct the test fairly."
    ph "如果你想听听我的专业建议，那就公平地改一下那场考试吧。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1772
translate schinese ep10_ipb_label_72d3a74d:

    # ph "And I'd tell you to also keep a watchful eye on your students during class and future tests."
    ph "并且我建议你也要在课堂上和未来的考试中留意你的学生。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1774
translate schinese ep10_ipb_label_edf8e55e:

    # isa "Thank you, Professor."
    isa "谢谢，教授。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1776
translate schinese ep10_ipb_label_1239a723:

    # ph "And thank you, Mrs. Roberts. If this matter crosses my path in the future, I'll make sure to let you know."
    ph "谢谢您，罗伯茨太太。如果这件事以后再发生，我会及时通知您的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1782
translate schinese ep10_ipb_label_a4e11f2e:

    # ph "I did. I missed it the first time, but some lines of reasoning didn't justify the answer."
    ph "我看到了。第一次没注意到，但有些推理过程并不能支持那个答案。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1783
translate schinese ep10_ipb_label_963ceaca:

    # ph "That's not necessarily surprising, but when the answer was correct down to the last decimal while showing an erroneous calculation, it strikes me as odd."
    ph "这并不一定让人意外，但当答案精确到小数点后几位，却展示出错误的计算过程，这就让我觉得有些奇怪。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1785
translate schinese ep10_ipb_label_77740e3b:

    # ph "That, combined with your data, makes me concerned that you are right about this student."
    ph "加上你的数据，让我担心你这个学生说的可能是真的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1786
translate schinese ep10_ipb_label_7c5a3b2a:

    # ph "I believe you are onto something, but I cannot prove how they cheated on the test."
    ph "我相信你察觉到了什么，但目前还无法证明他们考试作弊。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1788
translate schinese ep10_ipb_label_a2053168:

    # ph "And my findings are hardly sufficient to make these grave accusations. And when you add that we aren't supposed to share this knowledge with each other..."
    ph "我的调查结果远不足以做出这些严重的指控。而且当你加上我们本不该互相分享这些信息……"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1789
translate schinese ep10_ipb_label_1304994b:

    # ph "...as much as it hurts my academic heart, I move to let it slide this time. But also to keep a watchful eye on the student during class and future tests."
    ph "虽然伤了我的学术自尊，但这次我决定暂时放过他。不过我也会在课堂上和以后的考试中多留意这个学生。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1790
translate schinese ep10_ipb_label_8b2d07b0:

    # ph "Perhaps we have a chance to find damning evidence now that you've opened our eyes to it."
    ph "现在我们有机会找到确凿证据了，既然你已经让我们看清了真相。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1792
translate schinese ep10_ipb_label_975fda3d:

    # isa "I have to agree."
    isa "我同意。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1794
translate schinese ep10_ipb_label_659604ac:

    # ph "Excellent. The only remaining conundrum is translating the student ID number into a name."
    ph "很好。现在唯一剩下的问题就是把学生ID号转换成名字。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1796
translate schinese ep10_ipb_label_3658228f:

    # isa "I have the tools for it. The library connects the student ID card to the students."
    isa "我有办法。图书馆可以把学生卡和学生名字连起来。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:1798
translate schinese ep10_ipb_label_11bda164:

    # ph "Well, then, let's have a look. We might as well go all the way."
    ph "那我们就开始吧。咱们干脆一不做二不休。"

