translate schinese ep10_library_label_ff6f7774:

    # isa "And I asked Professor Hoff to investigate his exam, too."
    isa "我让霍夫教授也调查了他的考试。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2285
translate schinese ep10_library_label_7b09986a:

    # mc "You told Professor Hoff I cheated!?"
    mc "你告诉霍夫教授我作弊了？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2287
translate schinese ep10_library_label_21ce88ce:

    # isa "That was before I knew it was you."
    isa "那还是在我知道是你之前的事。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2288
translate schinese ep10_library_label_fdef219d:

    # isa "And that shouldn't even matter. Why the hell are you cheating?"
    isa "这根本不该有影响。你他妈为什么还要作弊？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2289
translate schinese ep10_library_label_f461626e:

    # isa "You're not this stupid! This will get you into big trouble, [name]. Don't you get that?"
    isa "你不是这么蠢！这会让你陷入大麻烦，[name]你难道不明白吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2291
translate schinese ep10_library_label_42e8ddda:

    # mc "I didn't think ahead... I went to the bathroom, found some papers lodged behind the toilet tank, and started reading them."
    mc "我没想那么多……我去洗手间，发现马桶水箱后面塞着几张纸，就随手翻看起来。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2292
translate schinese ep10_library_label_e72c2009:

    # mc "It turned out they were test answers-"
    mc "结果居然是考试答案——"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2294
translate schinese ep10_library_label_b6f3ae11:

    # isa "Test answers? {b}The{/b} test answers?"
    isa "考题答案？{b}这{/b}测试答案？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2296
translate schinese ep10_library_label_d2732515:

    # mc "No, not just the answers to the test, but a bunch of test questions and answers."
    mc "不只是考试答案，而是一大堆试题和对应答案。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2297
translate schinese ep10_library_label_6c06e523:

    # mc "I found a few on my test and read the answers to them."
    mc "我在我考试卷上找到了几张纸，看了那些题目的答案。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2298
translate schinese ep10_library_label_dfb8c1c3:

    # mc "And after the math test, the same thing happened during the English test."
    mc "数学考试之后，英语考试时也发生了同样的事。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2300
translate schinese ep10_library_label_57e93af1:

    # isa "There were papers behind the toilet tank again?"
    isa "马桶水箱后面又藏着一叠纸？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2302
translate schinese ep10_library_label_84d9991b:

    # mc "Yes..."
    mc "嗯……"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2304
translate schinese ep10_library_label_c3be3f41:

    # isa "Describe the papers to me."
    isa "给我描述一下那些纸。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2306
translate schinese ep10_library_label_a1dd6ffe:

    # mc "They were printed pages full of questions and answers. They weren't in any kind of order or anything."
    mc "那些都是印着题目和答案的纸页，乱七八糟地堆在一起，根本没有顺序可言。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2308
translate schinese ep10_library_label_a4d5311e:

    # isa "How many papers were there?"
    isa "有多少张纸？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2310
translate schinese ep10_library_label_eaedf2b1:

    # mc "I don't know - a lot."
    mc "我不知道——一大堆。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2312
translate schinese ep10_library_label_86580725:

    # mc "Like this much when stacked together."
    mc "像这样堆在一起。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2314
translate schinese ep10_library_label_2745e9a1:

    # mc "So...what's gonna happen to me?"
    mc "那……我接下来会怎么样？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2316
translate schinese ep10_library_label_8097f9e8:

    # isa "Huh?"
    isa "嗯？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2318
translate schinese ep10_library_label_027a032f:

    # mc "Am I getting expelled?"
    mc "我会被开除吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2320
translate schinese ep10_library_label_b40f845c:

    # isa "Luckily for you, you didn't get caught on Philip's test."
    isa "幸好你没有在Philip的考试中被抓住。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2322
translate schinese ep10_library_label_ee87e6f3:

    # mc "Oh?"
    mc "哦？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2324
translate schinese ep10_library_label_e8a4ca93:

    # isa "But he's keeping an eye on you from now on. He is suspicious and if you cheat again, make no mistake, he will catch you."
    isa "但他现在会一直盯着你。他已经开始怀疑了，如果你再作弊，别想瞒过去，他一定会抓到你。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2325
translate schinese ep10_library_label_380b2306:

    # isa "And if that happens, you will get expelled."
    isa "如果你被发现了，你就会被开除。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2327
translate schinese ep10_library_label_ba62645f:

    # mc "And what about you? You're not gonna punish me, are you?"
    mc "那你怎么看？你不会惩罚我吧？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2329
translate schinese ep10_library_label_a8cbfc0c:

    # isa "I'm not going to report you, [name]."
    isa "我不会举报你[name]."

# episode10\update10.rpy:2331
translate schinese ep10_library_label_c52b2f78:

    # mc "*{i}Phew{/i}* Thank you. That's good..."
    mc "*{i}呼——{/i}谢谢。那很好……"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2333
translate schinese ep10_library_label_8a8a5326:

    # isa "It's not good."
    isa "这可不好。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2334
translate schinese ep10_library_label_360cf270:

    # isa "Do you realize what situation you've put me in?"
    isa "你明白自己把我逼到了什么地步吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2340
translate schinese ep10_library_label_b7352a8b:

    # mc "I do... I'm sorry! I won't do it again."
    mc "我...我道歉！我不会再这样了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2342
translate schinese ep10_library_label_e46b5349:

    # isa "Even so. If it was anyone but you doing this, I would have reported it."
    isa "就算如此。要是换作别人这么做，我早就举报了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2346
translate schinese ep10_library_label_cb1c734d:

    # mc "You're overreacting, Bella. It was just a couple of tests. There's no harm done."
    mc "你太过了，贝拉。就几个测试而已，没造成什么伤害。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2348
translate schinese ep10_library_label_b6d189a2:

    # isa "No harm done?"
    isa "没造成什么伤害？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2349
translate schinese ep10_library_label_51335a27:

    # isa "If it was anyone but you doing this, I would have reported it."
    isa "就算换成别人做这事，我也会举报的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2350
translate schinese ep10_library_label_96010de1:

    # isa "And because I care so damned much about you, I have to tarnish my professional integrity to protect you."
    isa "因为我在乎你他妈的，所以我必须毁掉自己的职业操守来保护你。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2352
translate schinese ep10_library_label_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "..."

# episode10\update10.rpy:2353
translate schinese ep10_library_label_76907587:

    # mc "Bella... You don't have to protect me. Go ahead and report me."
    mc "贝拉……你不用保护我。去举报我吧。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2355
translate schinese ep10_library_label_d46897da:

    # isa "I can't do that."
    isa "我不能这么做。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2357
translate schinese ep10_library_label_753f498f:

    # mc "If I knew you'd be affected by me cheating on a stupid test, I wouldn't have done it."
    mc "如果我知道作弊会害得你这么难受，我根本就不会做。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2358
translate schinese ep10_library_label_a86be564:

    # mc "I'd rather face the consequences than hurt you like that."
    mc "我宁愿承受后果，也不愿让你受到这样的伤害。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2360
translate schinese ep10_library_label_3cfcf4b2:

    # isa "You don't need to cheat, [name]. You are smarter than this."
    isa "你不需要作弊，[name]你比这聪明。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2362
translate schinese ep10_library_label_a560ed76:

    # mc "What if I'm not? College isn't that easy for me. I don't understand everything they try to teach me."
    mc "那我呢？我可能根本就做不到。大学对我来说并不容易，我根本听不懂他们想教我的东西。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2363
translate schinese ep10_library_label_30fac2f5:

    # mc "And I guess I'm scared to fail...that's why I cheated."
    mc "而且我猜我就是害怕失败……所以才作弊的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2365
translate schinese ep10_library_label_92843002:

    # isa "When you're cheating, you are failing yourself, [name]. What if you make it through college like that?"
    isa "当你作弊时，你是在辜负自己。[name]要是你这样混过大学会怎样？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2366
translate schinese ep10_library_label_b8aeb12f:

    # isa "Every day for the rest of your life, you'll look back at college, wondering if you could have done it without cheating."
    isa "你这辈子每天都会回想起大学时光，怀疑自己是不是本可以不用作弊就撑过来。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2368
translate schinese ep10_library_label_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "..."

# episode10\update10.rpy:2369
translate schinese ep10_library_label_f997a7dc:

    # mc "How do you know?"
    mc "你怎么知道的？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2371
translate schinese ep10_library_label_c57e1492:

    # isa "Because I copied the answers from a neighbor on a test in college, it was during my freshman year, too."
    isa "因为我也是在大学一年级的时候，从旁边的同学那儿抄答案才通过考试的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2372
translate schinese ep10_library_label_a1eb4193:

    # isa "I had partied too much and neglected my studies. And when I wrote the test, I didn't know the answers to half of the questions."
    isa "我玩得太疯了，功课都给耽误了。考试的时候，有一半的问题我根本不知道答案。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2373
translate schinese ep10_library_label_222e9ae9:

    # isa "I panicked, glanced to my right, and copied everything I could see from Jessica..."
    isa "我慌了，往右边瞄了一眼，然后抄下了我能看到的所有答案..."

# episode10\update10.rpy:2375
translate schinese ep10_library_label_fa3e897c:

    # isa "I passed the test, barely. But I wouldn't have passed if I hadn't copied her answers."
    isa "我勉强及格了，但要是没抄她的答案，我肯定挂科。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2376
translate schinese ep10_library_label_1346f1a4:

    # isa "And I have regretted that ever since."
    isa "从那以后我一直后悔着。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2377
translate schinese ep10_library_label_4e2b8e4a:

    # isa "And that's what I hope you will do too."
    isa "也希望你这么做。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2379
translate schinese ep10_library_label_92bf9dab:

    # isa "Learn from this mistake, [name]. That's all I will ask of you."
    isa "从这个错误中吸取教训[name]这就是我唯一要求你的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2381
translate schinese ep10_library_label_61fb988e:

    # isa "If this happens again, you'll leave me no choice."
    isa "如果再这样下去，我只能采取更极端的手段了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2395
translate schinese ep10_library_label_0ad7a4b0:

    # mc "So... How are you?"
    mc "所以……你怎么样？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2397
translate schinese ep10_library_label_8f59568d:

    # mc "How are you?"
    mc "你怎么样？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2399
translate schinese ep10_library_label_85afa123:

    # ji "Not well. I don't know where to start."
    ji "不太好吧。我不知道从哪里说起。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2400
translate schinese ep10_library_label_4e3e152e:

    # ji "*{i}Sigh{/i}* I saw the posters on campus today."
    ji "*{i}叹气{/i}我今天在校园里看到了海报。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2402
translate schinese ep10_library_label_fd0eebd5:

    # mc "Yeah, those. It sucks... Someone is spreading the pictures we have on a wall in the mansion."
    mc "对，就是那些。真糟糕……有人正在散播豪宅墙上的照片。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2403
translate schinese ep10_library_label_81d27d6f:

    # mc "Maybe you saw them at Halloween?"
    mc "你可能在万圣节的时候见过？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2405
translate schinese ep10_library_label_f6670132:

    # ji "No, I didn't. I mean, I think I saw some of the pictures, but I didn't pay attention to them until today."
    ji "不，我没注意看。我是说，我觉得我看到过一些照片，但直到今天我才开始留意它们。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2406
translate schinese ep10_library_label_340ff069:

    # ji "I'm sorry they spread like that, but it's not why I'm bringing them up."
    ji "真抱歉它们传得那么开，但不是因为这个我才提起它们的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2408
translate schinese ep10_library_label_d4f013c5:

    # ji "There was this one picture that caught my eye...and I need you to be honest with me."
    ji "有一张照片特别吸引我……你得老实告诉我。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2410
translate schinese ep10_library_label_2bfc5150:

    # ji "This one is from our mansion. Isn't it?"
    ji "这张是咱们宅邸的，对吧？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2411
translate schinese ep10_library_label_1995df2f:

    # ji "That's Tybalt's bed."
    ji "那是Tybalt的床。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2412
translate schinese ep10_library_label_7e4137b2:

    # mc "Yeah. You called it. It's a Hell Week thing at the DIKs."
    mc "对，被你说中了。这是DIKs兄弟会地狱周的活动。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2413
translate schinese ep10_library_label_0e39eb51:

    # ji "And those masks... They look like burglars, don't they?"
    ji "那些面具……它们看起来像小偷，对吧？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2415
translate schinese ep10_library_label_da8c7924:

    # ji "It led me to think about a break-in we had at the start of the semester when two burglars entered our mansion and stole things from us."
    ji "这让我想起了开学初我们家发生的一次入室盗窃，有两个小偷闯进了我们的豪宅，偷走了我们的东西。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2416
translate schinese ep10_library_label_a4fc6f3b:

    # ji "This was during the time you had your Hell Week."
    ji "这是你在地狱周的时候。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2418
translate schinese ep10_library_label_021e98e8:

    # ji "Is there anything you'd like to tell me?"
    ji "你有什么想对我说的吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2420
translate schinese ep10_library_label_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "..."

# episode10\update10.rpy:2421
translate schinese ep10_library_label_5548f252:

    # mc "I'm sorry... It was before I knew you."
    mc "对不起...那是在我认识你之前的事。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2423
translate schinese ep10_library_label_1ac87104:

    # ji "[name]..."
    ji "[name]..."

# episode10\update10.rpy:2425
translate schinese ep10_library_label_29a48367:

    # mc "We had to do it for Hell Week. They wanted us to take funny pictures in Tybalt's room. And we had to enter your mansion through your room."
    mc "我们为了地狱周不得不这么做。他们让我们在Tybalt的房间里拍些搞笑的照片。而且我们还得从你的房间进入你的庄园。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2426
translate schinese ep10_library_label_f0b706ca:

    # mc "Your window was open."
    mc "你家的窗户是开着的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2428
translate schinese ep10_library_label_339997af:

    # ji "And you stole from me and Tybalt."
    ji "你偷了我的东西，还有Tybalt。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2430
translate schinese ep10_library_label_766fbcc4:

    # mc "What? No!"
    mc "什么？不！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2431
translate schinese ep10_library_label_f5991264:

    # mc "Wait... Derek stole Tybalt's mounted deer head."
    mc "等等……Derek偷走了Tybalt的挂墙鹿头。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2434
translate schinese ep10_library_label_b45cdd04:

    # mc "And oh... I may have taken some of your money, but it was only a few dollars and they were just lying there."
    mc "而且啊……我可能拿了一些你的钱，但也就几美元，而且它们本来就在那儿躺着。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2436
translate schinese ep10_library_label_6cdd5a4b:

    # mc "But that's it."
    mc "但这就是全部了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2440
translate schinese ep10_library_label_f46034b2:

    # ji "Wasn't a lot...? Are you justifying the amount you stole from me? And just because something lies there, it's ok to take it?"
    ji "没偷多少……？你是在为偷我东西找借口吗？东西随便躺在那儿就拿走，这就算合理？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2442
translate schinese ep10_library_label_1e978a0e:

    # mc "No... Fuck, of course not. I don't know why I did that. I didn't think clearly; I was high on adrenaline. I'll pay you back."
    mc "不……该死，当然不是。我不知道自己为什么会这么做，我当时脑子一片混乱，只是被肾上腺素冲昏了头。我马上还给你。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2446
translate schinese ep10_library_label_38672d0f:

    # ji "It's not about the money, [name]. It's more about the underwear you stole and the feeling you left me feel."
    ji "这不关乎金钱，[name]更多是关于你偷走的内衣和你留在我心里的感觉。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2448
translate schinese ep10_library_label_eaaf4508:

    # ji "And you stole my underwear and left me feeling horrible."
    ji "你偷了我的内衣，还让我感觉糟透了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2449
translate schinese ep10_library_label_9da0cd62:

    # ji "I had trouble sleeping because I felt like my privacy was violated."
    ji "我睡不着觉，因为感觉我的隐私被侵犯了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2451
translate schinese ep10_library_label_b963ca48:

    # mc "No! I never did that. Tybalt must have stolen those."
    mc "不！我从来没做过那种事。一定是Tybalt偷的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2453
translate schinese ep10_library_label_79124e41:

    # ji "Oh, [name]..."
    ji "哦，[name]..."

# episode10\update10.rpy:2455
translate schinese ep10_library_label_e27f1034:

    # mc "I'm telling you the truth! When we were escaping through your window, we saw Tybalt in your room."
    mc "我跟你说实话！我们从你窗户逃走的时候，看到Tybalt在你房间里。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2456
translate schinese ep10_library_label_160a794e:

    # mc "It looked like he was smelling underwear from your dresser. He saw us and called on security, not that he'd ever admit that."
    mc "看起来他好像是在闻你衣柜里的内衣。他看见我们了，叫了保安，不过他肯定不会承认这一点。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2458
translate schinese ep10_library_label_55eb393b:

    # mc "Jill... You have to believe me."
    mc "Jill...你得相信我。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2459
translate schinese ep10_library_label_cf3078c2:

    # mc "I did a shitty thing because of Hell Week, and I should have told you sooner, but part of me wanted to forget about it."
    mc "我因为地狱周做了件蠢事，本该早点告诉你，但有一部分的我就是想把它忘了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2460
translate schinese ep10_library_label_e9b2fb0b:

    # mc "And after getting to know you, I didn't think it mattered anymore."
    mc "认识你之后，我就不觉得那件事有什么了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2462
translate schinese ep10_library_label_5d9abcac:

    # mc "I didn't steal your underwear. Come on. You can't believe that."
    mc "我没偷你内裤。拜托，你不能这么相信我。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2463
translate schinese ep10_library_label_ae756f62:

    # mc "With everything Tybalt has done to you and me... You have to see through him by now."
    mc "Tybalt对你我做了那么多事……你现在总该看清他的真面目了吧。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2465
translate schinese ep10_library_label_741cf429:

    # ji "I thought I knew you too, [name]. And I don't get it... You do good things; you do bad things..."
    ji "我也以为自己了解你，[name]。可我不明白……你会做好事，也会做坏事……"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2466
translate schinese ep10_library_label_c1a2e5e0:

    # ji "And right now, I don't know what to believe."
    ji "现在我都不知道该相信什么了。"

