    mc "看你那副自信的样子。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2974
translate schinese ep10_math_label_444b29c4:

    # de "What about you?"
    de "你呢？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2977
translate schinese ep10_math_label_a484f272:

    # mc "Yeah... I passed."
    mc "嗯……我过了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2979
translate schinese ep10_math_label_8244aa6e:

    # mc "(And now I feel ashamed about it... Bella was right.)"
    mc "现在我感觉很丢脸……贝拉说得对。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2981
translate schinese ep10_math_label_d79efdeb:

    # mc "(And I guess my punishment is the guilt and knowing that Philip has his eyes on me...)"
    mc "（我猜我的惩罚就是内疚，还有知道Philip正盯着我看……）"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2985
translate schinese ep10_math_label_93e68a0e:

    # mc "I passed."
    mc "我过了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2987
translate schinese ep10_math_label_f0ece1df:

    # de "Nice. But it doesn't matter; they're not our final grades."
    de "不错。但没关系；她们不是我们的最终成绩。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2989
translate schinese ep10_math_label_adaa73f7:

    # mc "They're a part of it."
    mc "这是其中的一部分。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2992
translate schinese ep10_math_label_2ed0e48e:

    # ph "Ok, the minute is up. I don't want to see anyone fiddling with their phones now."
    ph "好了，时间到了。现在谁也不许摆弄手机了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2993
translate schinese ep10_math_label_0e0f6544:

    # ph "You can discuss the test after class."
    ph "你们课后可以讨论这次考试。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2995
translate schinese ep10_math_label_bc6b8cac:

    # ph "If you felt that the first half of the course went by fast, you will be surprised about the second half."
    ph "如果你觉得这门课前半段过得飞快，那你对后半段会更惊讶。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2996
translate schinese ep10_math_label_2101c09f:

    # ph "You'll take the finals before winter break and, as I'm sure all other teachers also say, it will be here in no time."
    ph "你们会在寒假前参加期末考试，正如我敢肯定其他老师也常说的那样，它很快就来了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2998
translate schinese ep10_math_label_eae5d18f:

    # ph "We have plenty left of the curriculum to cover before that, so let's begin."
    ph "我们还有不少课程内容要讲完，那我们开始吧。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:2999
translate schinese ep10_math_label_85c5251a:

    # ph "Thanks to Cathy, I believe you are somewhat familiar with this next chapter. We will dive head first into Lagrange interpolation."
    ph "多亏了Cathy，我相信你们对接下来这一章已经有所了解了。我们现在就直接进入拉格朗日插值法的内容。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3002
translate schinese ep10_math_label_fde474b5:

    # ph "But do not be frightened by it. With some studying, you will soon understand it well."
    ph "但别被它吓到。只要好好学习，你们很快就能理解得很透彻。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3057
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_ad3ace5b:

    # js "I didn't understand this the first time...and it doesn't make much more sense the second time."
    js "我第一次没听懂……第二次听还是没什么头绪。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3061
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_90df937d:

    # my "*{i}Sigh{/i}* When will I ever use this in my line of work?"
    my "*{i}叹气{/i}我什么时候能在工作中用上这个？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3063
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_2910ce21:

    # ly "Yup. I'm with you, sister. I'm thankful this is the only math credit I need."
    ly "嗯，我跟你一样，姐。谢天谢地，这门数学课是我唯一需要的学分。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3065
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_81648e97:

    # my "Sister? So, you know about it?"
    my "姐妹？所以你听说了？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3067
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_60d35cd5:

    # ly "Yeah, I heard that you're returning to the HOTs."
    ly "嗯，我听说你要回HOT姐妹会了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3069
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_b76f2931:

    # my "I've been meaning to tell everyone."
    my "我本来就想告诉大伙的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3071
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_da4735cd:

    # ly "Don't bother. Everyone already knows. Sage wants us to throw a party for you."
    ly "别费劲了。大家早都知道了。Sage想让我们给你办个派对。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3073
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_9e42e75c:

    # my "Ugh... Yeah, she mentioned that. I told her it wasn't necessary."
    my "唉...是啊，她提到了。我跟她说没必要搞这么一出。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3075
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_913cbeb8:

    # ly "Think of it as any other party. She asked me to find out what you wanna do but in secret."
    ly "把它当成任何其他聚会一样想。她让我偷偷打听你想怎么搞。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3076
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_c40178d7:

    # ly "And I'm not one for beating around the bush, so I figured I'd just ask you. What do you wanna do?"
    ly "我可没兴趣绕弯子，所以直接问你，你想干嘛？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3078
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_4bd24d9d:

    # js "Lily... You're not meant to ruin the surprise."
    js "Lily……你可别把惊喜提前说漏了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3080
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_660659c8:

    # ly "What surprise? She already knows about the party."
    ly "什么惊喜？她早就知道要办派对了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3081
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_75fe19dd:

    # ly "I think it's better if we come up with something fun instead of pretending it's not happening or guessing what she wants."
    ly "我觉得我们还是想点有趣的事做吧，别假装这事没发生，或者猜她想要什么。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3083
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_984550b9:

    # my "I don't know what I want to do. I'm up for everything, I guess."
    my "我不知道自己想做什么。我猜我什么都愿意尝试。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3085
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_6968057c:

    # ly "You're not up for everything."
    ly "你不是什么都能接受。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3087
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_e44eec09:

    # my "Maybe not everything, but I don't have any demands."
    my "也许不是所有，但我没什么特别要求。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3089
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_11d49f3c:

    # ly "Let's simplify things... Do you want me to invite guys to the party or not?"
    ly "让我们把事情简单点说……你是想让我邀请男生来派对，还是不想？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3091
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_9c5e63f6:

    # js "Didn't Sage want a HOTs-only party?"
    js "难道Sage不想办个纯女生派对吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3093
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_b3033386:

    # ly "She asked me to find out what Maya wanted. And, Josy, let's be real..."
    ly "她让我去问一下Maya想要什么。还有，Josy，说实话……"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3094
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_b89612ee:

    # ly "Girls-only parties are no fun."
    ly "女生聚会一点都不好玩。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3096
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_f3f27079:

    # my "I don't mind if there are guys at the party."
    my "我没介意有男生来派对。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3098
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_392baac1:

    # ly "See! Maya wants guys to come. It's a good thing I asked her."
    ly "看！Maya想让男生来。我问她一下是挺好的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3100
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_0455c44e:

    # js "Haha, I guess it is."
    js "哈哈，我想也是。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3102
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_f060ff9b:

    # ly "Now, I have to check with the DIKs and we got ourselves a party. And that's how you do it."
    ly "现在我只要再问问DIKs那边，派对就成了。看吧，事情就该这么办。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3107
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_671737ca:

    # ph "That's it for today. Have a nice end to your day, everyone. Class dismissed."
    ph "这就是今天的课程了，大家祝你们有个愉快的结束，下课。"

