translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_c9af4233:

    # ly "What? You insult me. Don't you think I'm smart?"
    ly "什么？你是在侮辱我？你就不觉得我聪明吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3122
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_bdd88642:

    # mc "Now I do."
    mc "现在我知道了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3124
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_98b99551:

    # mc "I don't know what I was thinking when I said that. I'm happy you passed."
    mc "我不知道我当时是怎么想的，说那种话。你通过了，我挺高兴的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3125
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_0509e6ad:

    # mc "And now I know you're smart."
    mc "现在我知道你挺聪明的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3127
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_5c285eff:

    # ly "Haha! You still have things to learn about me."
    ly "哈哈！你还有好多东西要了解我呢。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3129
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_f134cc8c:

    # ly "But it seems like everyone on campus has learned about you. Wink wink..."
    ly "但看起来校园里每个人都已经知道你了。眨眨眼……"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3131
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_d29cd05a:

    # mc "The posters? Yeah, that shit is embarrassing. They keep popping up..."
    mc "那些海报？是啊，这他妈丢人。它们一直在出现……"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3133
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_984baec6:

    # ly "You know that you have to own it, right? That's the only way to do it."
    ly "你知道你得接受它，对吧？这是唯一能做的方式。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3135
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_374bda0f:

    # mc "I've been trying to ignore it."
    mc "我一直试着不去理会。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3137
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_8eec9cff:

    # ly "It's not bad to have everyone know you're hung like a horse."
    ly "这没什么不好的，大家都知道你像匹马一样壮。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3139
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_13d08002:

    # mc "My brothers don't look at it that way. Some of them feel embarrassed."
    mc "我的兄弟们可没这么想。他们中有些人还挺不好意思的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3141
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_f9336736:

    # ly "Tough shit. Then they shouldn't have made a fucking memorabilia wall full of those pictures."
    ly "狗屎，那他们当初就不该搞个他妈的纪念墙挂满这些照片。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3143
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_2953a1c9:

    # ly "But I'm thrilled they did. Even though people laugh and stare, there's no such thing as bad news."
    ly "但我很高兴他们这么做了。就算大家笑嘻嘻地盯着看，也不存在什么坏消息。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3146
translate schinese after_math_result_ep10_label_63d449a9:

    # ly "When they figure out it's you, guys will be jealous of you, and you bet your ass that girls will be jealous of me."
    ly "当他们发现是你的时候，大家都会嫉妒你，你他妈的肯定会让女孩们嫉妒我。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3151
translate schinese ep10_zoey_label_62ad93cb:

    # zmom "And if you leave the register, make sure you click log out."
    zmom "如果你离开收银台，记得点退出登录。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3153
translate schinese ep10_zoey_label_7c08c536:

    # zo "Log out when I stretch my legs - got it."
    zo "伸腿时记得先退出登录——明白了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3154
translate schinese ep10_zoey_label_b081b893:

    # zo "I don't know how you do this every day. Is it always this slow?"
    zo "我不知道你每天是怎么熬过来的。这会儿是不是一直都这么慢？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3156
translate schinese ep10_zoey_label_42c848d7:

    # zmom "This time of day, it is. It's when we get time to restock the shelves and do other tasks such as updating prices and putting up sales signs."
    zmom "这时候嘛，就是我们休息补货、做其他事情的时候，比如更新价格、挂促销牌子这种。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3157
translate schinese ep10_zoey_label_dbce2334:

    # zmom "Speaking of which, I have some work to do with just that. Will you be ok here on your own?"
    zmom "说到这个，我有些事得单独处理一下，你一个人在这里能行吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3159
translate schinese ep10_zoey_label_10a6f697:

    # zo "Yeah, I'll shout if I need you."
    zo "嗯，我喊你就行。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3160
translate schinese ep10_zoey_label_8a0939e4:

    # zo "And, oh! Can I draw while I wait for customers to show?"
    zo "而且，哦！等顾客来了我能不能画点东西？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3162
translate schinese ep10_zoey_label_25ce2aa7:

    # zmom "Hm... Sorry, sweetheart. But it doesn't look professional if you do that."
    zmom "嗯... 对不起，宝贝。但如果你这么做看起来就不专业了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3165
translate schinese ep10_zoey_label_c27f871d:

    # zo "(Phone it is... Like everyone else at this place... Because that looks {b}way{/b} more professional.)"
    zo "（手机……就像这里每个人一样……因为那看起来）{b}方式{/b}更专业。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3304
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_d39266fb:

    # mc "(Come on, [name]! Don't get gassed out yet.)"
    mc "来吧，[name]别急着晕倒。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3316
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_bca3b10f:

    # no "What a shame. Here I am, done with my workout, and I run into you."
    no "真遗憾啊。我刚做完锻炼，就碰上你了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3318
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_141f3c8f:

    # mc "Oh, Nora! Hi!"
    mc "哦，Nora！嗨！"

