translate schinese ep10_gym_label_99d0d2c8:

    # no "I've been waiting for your phone call. Are you playing hard to get or what?"
    no "我一直在等你的电话。你是故意装矜持吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3323
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_cfdef34a:

    # mc "About that... I was gonna call you, but since we saw each other last time, I've gotten serious with someone."
    mc "关于那个……我本来打算给你打电话的，但自从上次见你之后，我跟别人认真起来了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3325
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_eeea477f:

    # no "Really?"
    no "真他妈的？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3327
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_fae6b46c:

    # mc "Yeah. And as my interest in you wasn't a friendship on my end, I didn't pick up the phone. Sorry."
    mc "是啊。因为我对你的兴趣并不只是友情，所以没有接电话。抱歉。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3329
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_8664649b:

    # no "No harm done, [name]. At least you're telling me now."
    no "没事的[name]至少你现在告诉我了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3330
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_d33eec67:

    # no "Good luck with the punching bag."
    no "祝你打沙袋好运。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3332
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_78bf6a01:

    # mc "Thanks! I'll see you around."
    mc "谢谢！回头见。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3334
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_6ea83308:

    # mc "(That sucked, but it had to be done.)"
    mc "（感觉很糟，但我必须这么做。）"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3336
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_6ba5dd83:

    # mc "If you have some stretching left, I'd gladly help out."
    mc "如果你还有时间拉伸，我乐意帮你。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3338
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_d457a113:

    # no "Haha, I bet you would."
    no "哈哈，你肯定也一样。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3340
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_442ffc7f:

    # mc "What have you been up to?"
    mc "最近在忙啥呢？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3342
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_99e849e0:

    # no "Not much. I recently came off an antibiotic treatment. My inner ear has been acting up."
    no "没怎么干啥。我刚结束抗生素疗程，内耳有点不舒服。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3343
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_58141b20:

    # no "It feels good to be back at the gym."
    no "重回健身房感觉真不错。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3345
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_ff0c837b:

    # mc "That sucks. Are you feeling ok?"
    mc "真他妈烦人。你感觉还好吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3347
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_3b3839b2:

    # no "I'm much better, thanks. I've been prone to ear infections all my life. It's annoying, but nothing to worry about."
    no "好多了，谢谢。我从小就容易耳朵发炎。虽然烦人，不过没什么可担心的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3348
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_4d669b95:

    # no "How about you?"
    no "你呢？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3350
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_7a4b7b80:

    # mc "I'm healthy and full of energy."
    mc "我状态很好，精神头儿十足。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3352
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_10c8a129:

    # no "That's good. I should be off now, but..."
    no "这很好。我现在该走了，但……"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3353
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_d454d032:

    # no "Since you're here, may I be bold enough to ask you for a date?"
    no "既然你在这里，我敢大胆问你，要出去约会吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3355
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_d24b7b1e:

    # mc "Oh, wow! A date?"
    mc "哦，哇！约会？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3357
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_9bf0a9d3:

    # no "I take it you're still interested. Are you?"
    no "那你是还感兴趣？对吧？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3362
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_badba80c:

    # mc "You know it. Tell me when and where."
    mc "你当然知道。跟我说个时间和地点。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3364
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_7a7ae00b:

    # no "Would Saturday be ok? I was thinking evening drinks at my place. What do you say?"
    no "周六可以吗？我本来打算晚上在我家喝点酒。你觉得怎么样？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3367
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_eee08c3c:

    # mc "(Fuck... I'm supposed to meet Nicole on Saturday...)"
    mc "（操……我约好周六和Nicole见面……）"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3371
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_e00590d2:

    # mc "(But I'm more into Nora... It sucks, but I'll have to cancel on Nicole.)"
    mc "（但我更喜欢Nora... 真是糟心，我得跟Nicole取消了。）"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3372
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_2db912c4:

    # mc "I'll have to move some things around, but I'm up for it."
    mc "我得调整一下安排，但没问题，我接受。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3375
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_88954195:

    # mc "Oh, that's not good for me. How about Sunday instead?"
    mc "哦，这对我可不太好。那改天周日吧？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3377
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_a11c66f3:

    # no "Sadly, I'm busy."
    no "可惜我有事。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3379
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_d9d300ad:

    # mc "Damn..."
    mc "该死..."

# episode10\update10.rpy:3383
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_c510f386:

    # mc "That's a shame. I can't cancel my plans."
    mc "真他妈可惜。我不能取消我的安排。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3385
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_d276f149:

    # no "That's ok. It was a spontaneous invite. There will be another time for it. Now I know that you're interested."
    no "这样也行。那是个临时的邀请。总会有其他时候的。现在我知道你感兴趣了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3386
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_b16a8786:

    # no "Until next time."
    no "下次见。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3388
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_93af5996:

    # mc "See you, Nora."
    mc "回头见，Nora。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3391
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_129a33d5:

    # mc "(I'm more into Nora than Nicole... It sucks, but I'll have to cancel on Nicole.)"
    mc "（比起Nicole，我更喜欢Nora……虽然很糟，但我得取消和Nicole的约会。）"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3392
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_94de5a3c:

    # mc "You know what? I'll have to move some things around, but I'm up for it."
    mc "我知道了，我得调整一下安排，但这次我挺想去的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3396
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_77dc3a6e:

    # no "I'll send you the directions."
    no "我会把路线发给你。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3397
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_3db2b733:

    # no "Does 8 p.m. work for you?"
    no "八点行不行？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3399
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_d6374454:

    # mc "It's a date."
    mc "这是约会。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3401
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_427d834f:

    # mc "(She asked me out... That's hot.)"
    mc "（她约我出去了……这就是我。）"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3403
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_ddcb55d9:

    # mc "I'm free as a bird."
    mc "我有空。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3405
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_77dc3a6e_1:

    # no "I'll send you the directions."
    no "我会把路线发给你。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3406
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_3db2b733_1:

    # no "Does 8 p.m. work for you?"
    no "八点行不行？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3408
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_d6374454_1:

    # mc "It's a date."
    mc "这是约会。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3410
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_427d834f_1:

    # mc "(She asked me out... That's hot.)"
    mc "（她约我出去……这他妈真带劲。）"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3413
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_db4ce301:

    # mc "I gotta be honest with you. I was interested back when I asked for your number..."
    mc "我得坦白告诉你，我当初要你电话号码的时候其实挺感兴趣的……"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3414
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_2f929b3c:

    # mc "...but my gut feeling is telling me no."
    mc "但我的直觉告诉我不是。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3416
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_2e23ae37:

    # no "It is?"
    no "这是什么意思？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3418
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_2c54b514:

    # mc "Yeah, I'm sorry. Things happen, you know?"
    mc "是啊，真的很抱歉。计划总会有变，对吧？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3420
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_23a25fa5:

    # no "Perhaps I should have been more eager."
    no "也许我应该更主动一点。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3422
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_e7eaa3c4:

    # mc "It's not you, Nora. It's me."
    mc "不是你，Nora，是我。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3424
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_bb1598f1:

    # no "That's the oldest lie in the book. But I understand. A no is a no."
    no "这是书里最老的谎言了。但我也理解，拒绝就是拒绝。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3426
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_c84a6d8a:

    # mc "I'll see you around, Nora."
    mc "回头见，Nora。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3428
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_abdad94a:

    # no "Sure."
    no "当然。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3430
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_7421d1ca:

    # mc "(Ugh... That didn't feel too good when she put herself out there and asked me out...)"
    mc "（唉……她都鼓起勇气主动约我了，这样拒绝她感觉真不好……）"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3431
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_a2146b2d:

    # mc "(But I had to be honest with myself. I don't feel it anymore.)"
    mc "但我得对自己诚实一点，我已经没那种感觉了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3443
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_29a7eeb0:

    # dwy "You wrapped your hands, huh?"
    dwy "你把手缠好了，是吧？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3445
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_8a386616:

    # mc "Hey! It's you. Yeah, thanks for that."
    mc "嘿！是你啊。对，谢谢你的帮忙。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3446
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_09d19f57:

    # mc "I spent some time reading up on exercises and whatnot and realized I was stupid."
    mc "我花了一些时间研究了一些锻炼方法，然后意识到自己真是个蠢货。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3448
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_fdfc8e40:

    # dwy "It's not stupid being a rookie."
    dwy "这不叫傻，当个新人而已。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3449
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_20474158:

    # dwy "Listening to advice from someone with experience tells me you're smart."
    dwy "听有经验的人给建议，说明你挺聪明的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3450
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_e862c757:

    # dwy "Some dudes around here get all pissy and defensive when you try to teach them how to do something."
    dwy "这里有些家伙，一听到你教他们怎么做事就急眼了，还一副防御姿态。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3452
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_bb3b322f:

    # mc "I'm [name], by the way."
    mc "我正在[name]顺便说一句。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3454
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_f01142a0:

    # dwy "Dwyane."
    dwy "Dwyane。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3456
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_7ab9a457:

    # dwy "I take it you're not in a club."
    dwy "你不是在某个俱乐部里吧。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3458
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_a9602a44:

    # mc "A fight club?"
    mc "打斗俱乐部？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3460
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_b5357e86:

    # dwy "Yeah."
    dwy "嗯。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3462
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_a5d4e377:

    # mc "No, I could never afford that."
    mc "不，我根本付不起那个钱。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3464
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_d2053462:

    # dwy "Missing out on the basics like that, you oughta think about joining one. There's one here."
    dwy "错过了这些基本的东西，你该考虑加入一个。这里有个。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3466
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_c5335b11:

    # mc "I'm fighting for self-defense and to stay in shape, but that's it."
    mc "我打是为了自卫和保持身材，就这些。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3467
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_4db03926:

    # mc "What about you?"
    mc "你呢？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3469
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_92476d25:

    # dwy "I used to scrap, but it was no way to make money. Not the way I was going at it."
    dwy "我以前干过街头斗殴，但那不是赚钱的路子。我那时候干那事纯粹是混日子。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3471
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_9ebf841c:

    # dwy "So, I shaped up and became a PT."
    dwy "所以我开始锻炼，成了私人教练。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3473
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_237e5b9a:

    # mc "A personal trainer?"
    mc "私人教练？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3475
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_27e8b538:

    # dwy "Mhm."
    dwy "嗯。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3476
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_31e60953:

    # dwy "These days, I'm like you. But I also spar with the boys so I don't lose it."
    dwy "现在我跟你也差不多，不过我还会跟那帮家伙对练一下，免得我太闲了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3478
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_101b95ad:

    # mc "So, you're not in the club either?"
    mc "所以你也不在兄弟会里？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3480
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_7f7e0cad:

    # dwy "I hang around but ain't got the time to stay competitive."
    dwy "我混在那儿，但没时间保持竞争力。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3481
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_c88eb46b:

    # dwy "You gotta be devoted to keep up with the best of them, you know what I'm saying?"
    dwy "你要想跟他们中的顶尖人物保持同步，得全身心投入，明白我的意思吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3483
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_7f08e5f1:

    # mc "Not really."
    mc "不太行。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3485
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_c1a0f8ed:

    # dwy "Eh."
    dwy "嗯。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3486
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_643b2564:

    # dwy "If you ever need coaching, holler at me."
    dwy "如果你需要训练指导，尽管找我。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3488
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_c452c1da:

    # mc "Thanks, but I can't afford a PT. This gym membership is what I could spare."
    mc "谢谢，但我负担不起私人教练。这个健身房会员费已经是我在省的了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3493
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_4f476932:

    # dwy "Come with."
    dwy "来吧。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3496
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_796e7de9:

    # mc "Wow! You have a ring in here."
    mc "哇！你这手真硬。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3498
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_2e03fa36:

    # dwy "Told you you're missing out."
    dwy "早说了你是在浪费机会。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3500
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_a4e6bab7:

    # dwy "Start punching the bag."
    dwy "开始打沙袋。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3502
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_66a7a5ca:

    # mc "What for?"
    mc "为啥？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3504
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_714f3f5b:

    # dwy "I've been in your spot. All broke and shit."
    dwy "我待过你这位置，全他妈破破烂烂的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3505
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_0999fc45:

    # dwy "I can always use someone else to train with, but if you're not up to speed, I ain't gonna bother."
    dwy "我随时可以找别人一起训练，但如果你跟不上节奏，我可就不想费劲了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3507
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_b4c4ce71:

    # dwy "Aight. Show me your speed. Pummel that bag."
    dwy "行啊。展示一下你的速度。好好捶那沙袋。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3508
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_5d336ed0:

    # mc "Speed? Don't you train that on a speed bag?"
    mc "速度？你不是该在速度袋上训练吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3509
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_18fbcae1:

    # dwy "A heavy bag works better for you. You're fighting at chest height, aren't you?"
    dwy "重袋对你更有效。你不是在胸部高度战斗吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3510
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_7a948e89:

    # dwy "The heavy bag is gonna let you pack on muscle. You look like you need some."
    dwy "重袋能帮你增肌。你看起来确实需要一些。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3512
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_798e70bc:

    # mc "Are you calling me scrawny?"
    mc "你是在说我瘦吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3514
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_8affd521:

    # dwy "I remember that dude you tried to fight. His left asscheek weighs more than you."
    dwy "我记得你之前跟那个家伙打过架，他左屁股的重量都比你重。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3515
translate schinese ep10_gym_label_ba7e166d:

    # dwy "You're not gonna stand a chance without packing power in that fist."
    dwy "你那拳头要是没点力气，根本撑不过去。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3604
translate schinese ep10_dwy_tut2_label_c2e9f586:

    # mc "*{i}Phew{/i}*"
    mc "*{i}呼——{/i}*"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3605
translate schinese ep10_dwy_tut2_label_4907862e:

    # dwy "That's 'nuff. Switch to kicks."
    dwy "够了。换踢腿。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3606
translate schinese ep10_dwy_tut2_label_a7f382e6:

    # mc "Can I take a breather?"
    mc "可以歇口气吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3609
translate schinese ep10_dwy_tut2_label_5a25bedc:

    # dwy "Nah. I wanna see your stamina. Powerful kicks, 30 seconds. Go!"
    dwy "不。我想看看你的耐力。强力踢击，三十秒。开始！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3651
translate schinese ep10_dwy_tut4_label_3f9d3869:

    # dwy "Dude, you're gassed out."
    dwy "哥们，你撑不住了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3652
translate schinese ep10_dwy_tut4_label_4e211c79:

    # dwy "Your kicks are lazy when you're gassed out. You need to work on that, for sure."
    dwy "你一体力透支，踢腿就会变得软弱无力。这个肯定得加强。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3656
translate schinese ep10_dwy_tut4_label_a4af3455:

    # dwy "A well-placed low kick will cripple your opponent."
    dwy "一记精准的低踢能让你的对手动弹不得。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3659
translate schinese ep10_dwy_tut4_label_d6387f15:

    # dwy "If you're fighting a big dude, some swift kicks to the side of his knee are gonna slow him down."
    dwy "如果你打的是个大块头，几下快踢到他膝盖侧面，就能让他慢下来。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3660
translate schinese ep10_dwy_tut4_label_b4a8a082:

    # dwy "You need to learn that, for sure."
    dwy "你肯定得学会这点。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3665
translate schinese ep10_dwy_tut4_label_ccb28598:

    # dwy "Aight. You had your rest. I wanna see you rage. Dig deep into that bag. 30 seconds. Go!"
    dwy "好，你已经休息够了。我要看到你爆发出来。用力打沙袋，三十秒，开始！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3691
translate schinese ep10_dwy_tut6_label_8030bab6:

    # dwy "Remember what I told you. Aim into the bag and follow through."
    dwy "记住我跟你说的。瞄准沙包，然后全力击打。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3694
translate schinese ep10_dwy_tut6_label_f08838ee:

    # dwy "Mix it up. Alternate. Highs and lows."
    dwy "变化节奏，交替进攻，高低结合。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3700
translate schinese ep10_dwy_tut6_label_091a0fe6:

    # dwy "Dig deep."
    dwy "深呼吸，全力以赴。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3703
translate schinese ep10_dwy_tut6_label_8d30ea4c:

    # dwy "Finish with a strong blow from the side."
    dwy "用侧边一记重拳收尾。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3711
translate schinese ep10_dwy_tut6_label_dd5e2b6d:

    # dwy "Now you do that to that walking fridge and you'll reset his brain to factory settings."
    dwy "现在你用这个打他那台行走的冰箱，他大脑就会重置成出厂设置。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3717
translate schinese ep10_dwy_tut6_label_5d63a232:

    # dwy "Think fast!"
    dwy "想快点！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3752
translate schinese ep10_dwy_tut9_label_fcc70020:

    # dwy "Quick thinking."
    dwy "机灵点。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3760
translate schinese ep10_dwy_tut9_label_809a7d85:

    # dwy "Aight, I've seen 'nuff."
    dwy "行了，我看得够多了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3762
translate schinese ep10_dwy_tut9_label_afd74152:

    # mc "What do you think?"
    mc "你他妈觉得怎么样？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3764
translate schinese ep10_dwy_tut9_label_951082ef:

    # dwy "You're a rookie. Ain't no way around it."
    dwy "你是新手。没得绕。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3765
translate schinese ep10_dwy_tut9_label_415b008e:

    # dwy "But it ain't bad. Because on a street level, yeah, you can scrap. You got a mad kick."
    dwy "但也不算太差。在街头混的话，你确实能打。你那脚法挺狠的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3766
translate schinese ep10_dwy_tut9_label_722aed88:

    # dwy "With some practice, you can hang with the best of us here."
    dwy "多加练习，你也能跟我们这些家伙打得有来有回。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3767
translate schinese ep10_dwy_tut9_label_46c6898c:

    # dwy "Hit me up the next time you're here and we'll train. No extra charge."
    dwy "下次你来的时候找我，我们训练一下。不额外收费。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3769
translate schinese ep10_dwy_tut9_label_baf1f34c:

    # mc "That would be great!"
    mc "这会很棒！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3771
translate schinese ep10_dwy_tut9_label_d9860daf:

    # dwy "But if you start sucking, I'm gonna charge you."
    dwy "但如果你除了傻乎乎的还爱哭鼻子，我可就要收你钱了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3773
translate schinese ep10_dwy_tut9_label_c1dff962:

    # mc "Oh..."
    mc "哦..."

# episode10\update10.rpy:3776
translate schinese ep10_dwy_tut9_label_186d019e:

    # dwy "This is not gonna work if you be all gullible and shit all the time."
    dwy "这样下去可不行，你要是老是这么傻乎乎的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3778
translate schinese ep10_dwy_tut9_label_4fd0b30b:

    # mc "Haha... Got it."
    mc "哈哈...明白了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3783
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_38633033:

    # le "Tommy! Come on! Be reasonable."
    le "Tommy！别这样！你得讲点道理。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3784
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_e1e1d70c:

    # tm "I am being reasonable, but you lost the bet."
    tm "我是在讲道理，但你输掉赌注了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3786
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_bad2bcc5:

    # le "Even after all those posters, you still want this picture on the wall?"
    le "就算贴了那么多海报，你还是想把这张照片挂墙上？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3788
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_501ff886:

    # tm "..."
    tm "..."

# episode10\update10.rpy:3790
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_d1fe8974:

    # tm "Yeah."
    tm "嗯。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3792
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_592e8ad0:

    # le "*{i}Sigh{/i}* It's not fair..."
    le "*{i}叹气{/i}* 这不公平……"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3794
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_6373b7d4:

    # le "[name]! Can you convince Tommy to remove my picture from the wall?"
    le "[name]你能说服Tommy把我的照片从墙上拿下来吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3797
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_8f50e868:

    # mc "I'm probably the last guy Tommy wants to listen to."
    mc "我可能是最后一个Tommy想听的人。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3799
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_7093a312:

    # tm "I don't know who said that, but if you see [name], tell him about DIKs' Thanksgiving. I'm counting on you for it."
    tm "不知道是谁说的，不过你要是见到[name]，就把DIKs感恩节的事告诉他。这事就指望你了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3801
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_9a1a1af4:

    # mc "Great... I'm invisible to you now. Real mature."
    mc "现在你对我来说就像空气一样。真成熟。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3805
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_86f6d229:

    # mc "Didn't you lose a bet?"
    mc "你不是输掉什么赌注了吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3807
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_9af7cc92:

    # tm "He sure did."
    tm "他确实这么做了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3809
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_f05b0346:

    # mc "Then, I'm with Tommy on this one."
    mc "那我可就同意Tommy的说法了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3812
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_5dc04c94:

    # mc "Tommy? How about it?"
    mc "Tommy？你怎么想？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3814
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_828f3e47:

    # tm "No. A bet is a bet."
    tm "不，赌注就是赌注。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3816
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_ad6ad7d4:

    # mc "Sorry, I tried."
    mc "抱歉，我试过了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3818
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_c9f2d7c5:

    # tm "Leon, fill him in on DIKs' Thanksgiving. Will you?"
    tm "Leon，给他讲讲DIKs的感恩节传统，好吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3820
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_3765e56b:

    # le "Sure..."
    le "当然。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3822
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_8e9cf96f:

    # mc "It's a tradition, right?"
    mc "这是个传统，对吧？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3824
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_12e3d5c7:

    # le "Yeah, and it's our turn to host it."
    le "嗯，轮到我们这边主办了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3826
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_6377204a:

    # mc "Oh, you never did it before?"
    mc "你以前从来没做过？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3828
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_71ca4af5:

    # le "I wasn't a DIK last year. We just partied with them."
    le "我去年也没当他们的主厨。我们只是和他们一起嗨了一晚。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3830
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_f5bd2e40:

    # mc "Right, I forgot."
    mc "对，我忘了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3832
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_cd8328c6:

    # le "Let's get Derek and Jamie for this."
    le "让我们把Derek和Jamie叫来吧。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3834
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_b26ec112:

    # de "What is DIKs' Thanksgiving?"
    de "什么是DIKs感恩节？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3836
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_c72d6f5d:

    # jm "They told me that it's when the recent maggots show their thanks to the elder DIKs by hosting a dinner party."
    jm "他们跟我说这是新人向老成员表示感谢的时候，会举办晚宴。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3838
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_b3b9892d:

    # mc "DIKs-only?"
    mc "只限DIKs成员？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3840
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_b2abc9a1:

    # jm "I'm not sure if there are any rules for it. I can check with Jacob."
    jm "我不确定有没有什么规矩。我可以问问Jacob。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3842
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_6baed412:

    # le "I don't think they are expecting anything spectacular. But it's a way to honor our brothers, so let's do our best."
    le "我觉得他们应该不会期待什么特别夸张的东西。不过这是为了致敬我们的兄弟们，所以咱们还是尽力去做吧。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3844
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_eee4bd25:

    # mc "Ok. Let's begin with the big questions. When, where and what will it be?"
    mc "好，我们先从几个大问题开始。什么时候、在哪里、要做什么？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3846
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_1fef1579:

    # le "We can't do it during actual Thanksgiving. How about the day before? Our break starts that Wednesday, anyway."
    le "我们不能在真正的感恩节那天搞。要不就选前一天？反正我们的假期就是从周三开始的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3848
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_2fc16a7b:

    # jm "Yeah, I'm sure many want to visit their real families that Thursday and maybe even over the weekend."
    jm "那周四很多兄弟可能都想去见他们真正的家人，甚至周末都可能出去。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3850
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_6e09af95:

    # mc "That Wednesday sounds good. What about the location?"
    mc "周三听起来不错。地点呢？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3852
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_232f8dc2:

    # de "We can do it here, but maybe it's a bit boring."
    de "我们可以在这里办，不过可能有点无聊。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3854
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_d932c9a4:

    # jm "Thinking about it, I know that Jacob and John Boy didn't host it here last year."
    jm "说到这个，我知道去年Jacob和John Boy没在这里办。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3855
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_6bf464b6:

    # jm "They went to a restaurant and then to the strip club."
    jm "他们去了餐厅，然后去了脱衣舞俱乐部。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3857
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_1ab8062e:

    # de "That sounds great! Let's do that!"
    de "这听起来不错！就这么定了！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3859
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_bd5b0e62:

    # le "We can't copy what they did, can we? It would feel cheap."
    le "我们不能照搬他们做的吧？那样会显得很廉价。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3861
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_82362dea:

    # de "Yeah, but what else can you do in November? It's gotten pretty cold outdoors."
    de "那倒是，十一月还能干啥？外面已经冷得不行了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3863
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_c7ac86b9:

    # mc "I guess outdoors could work if we made a fire, but that's about it."
    mc "我觉得如果我们在外面生个火的话，户外活动还是可以的，但也就这么多了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3865
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_aa360bd1:

    # jm "We could throw a barbecue."
    jm "我们可以搞个烧烤。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3867
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_f81db4ae:

    # le "Yeah! That could work. There's a spot for it near the lake."
    le "嗯！那主意不错。湖边有个地方正好可以搞。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3868
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_b7ecd47e:

    # le "We can have a big bonfire. And if people feel up for it, we could bring tents and spend the night."
    le "我们可以搞个大火堆。如果大家有兴致的话，还能搭帐篷过夜。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3869
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_c970a370:

    # le "The fire should keep us warm, but if it doesn't, it's just a short walk home."
    le "篝火能让我们暖和些，如果不够的话，走回家也只是一小段路。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3871
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_f23086ea:

    # de "Yes! Let's have a fire theme!"
    de "对！我们就搞个篝火主题！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3872
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_fe833a66:

    # de "I can make flaming shots for everyone!"
    de "我可以给大家调制火焰鸡尾酒！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3874
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_15c32647:

    # mc "Flaming shots?"
    mc "火焰鸡尾酒？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3876
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_a1c8694b:

    # de "Let me get my bottle and show you!"
    de "让我拿瓶酒来给你们看看！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3878
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_858b287d:

    # jm "We could make s'mores and drink beer all night. It sounds pretty damn fun if you ask me."
    jm "我们能做棉花糖，喝一整晚啤酒。要我说，这听起来挺他妈好玩的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3880
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_4c7ee954:

    # mc "These are all good ideas. I'm not too sure about the flaming shots. Derek will have to show us what that's about."
    mc "这些点子都不错。不过火焰鸡尾酒我还不太确定。Derek得给我们演示一下到底是什么意思。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3882
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_e06b53b6:

    # de "And all that's left is to ignite the shots like...this."
    de "然后就只剩下点燃这些酒了，就像……这样。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3885
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_c6936f56:

    # de "Cool, huh?"
    de "酷，对吧？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3886
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_387ad366:

    # mc "How can you drink that? Won't you catch on fire?"
    mc "你怎么能喝这个？不会被烧着吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3889
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_96f90f0c:

    # de "Obviously, you should put the fire out before you drink it. With your palm, like this!"
    de "显然，你该先把火灭了再喝。用你的手掌，像这样！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3893
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_d74aa64c:

    # de "Oh, fuck!"
    de "哦，见鬼！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3894
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_410db67f:

    # mc "Derek! What did you do?"
    mc "Derek！你干了什么？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3896
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_b6369ca9:

    # de "Don't panic! It's just a small house fire. No one's ever died from that."
    de "别慌！就只是个小火警。没人会因为这个死掉的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3898
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_1b1c8f8c:

    # jm "Get a fire extinguisher!"
    jm "拿灭火器！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3900
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_a670e1ed:

    # de "*{i}Blows frenetically{/i}*"
    de "*{i}狂乱地抽打{/i}*"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3901
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_d8f17cff:

    # mc "Should we use water!?"
    mc "该用灭火器！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3903
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_16b21309:

    # de "Huh? Won't that make it worse?"
    de "这会更糟吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3905
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_076cea9e:

    # mc "I don't know!"
    mc "我不知道！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3906
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_a670e1ed_1:

    # de "*{i}Blows frenetically{/i}*"
    de "*{i}狂乱地抽打{/i}*"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3908
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_cdc84706:

    # le "Get back!"
    le "退后！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3910
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_c802b044:

    # le "Huh? It doesn't work!"
    le "嗯？这招不管用啊！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3911
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_6552fd04:

    # mc "Why doesn't it work?"
    mc "为什么不管用？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3913
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_0b0ba5e7:

    # de "..."
    de "..."

# episode10\update10.rpy:3916
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_cfd8c593:

    # de "Ground control. This is a beautiful night for new steps of man."
    de "地面控制，这里是人类迈向新阶段的美妙夜晚。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3918
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_9aed636c:

    # de "Prepare for lift-off."
    de "准备起飞了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3921
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_82ab86d5:

    # de "ROCKET MAAAAN!!!"
    de "火箭人！！！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3924
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_0d03895f:

    # de "Ow! Ow! Ow! Fuck! My nuts!"
    de "哎哟！哎哟！哎哟！操！我蛋蛋了！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3926
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_db612627:

    # de "Fuck."
    de "操。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3929
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_e914f37e:

    # "*{i}PSSCCCHHHHH{/i}*"
    "*{i}嘶——{/i}*"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3937
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_341e56f7:

    # mc "No flaming shots. We don't wanna cause a forest fire."
    mc "没有加火药的酒。我们可不想引发一场森林大火。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3939
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_fb757b8a:

    # le "Hear, hear."
    le "听好了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3941
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_07771140:

    # de "Can I still help out with the alcohol?"
    de "还能帮我拿点酒吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3943
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_ef5d5288:

    # mc "Yeah, sure. Let's get into some specifics..."
    mc "嗯，行啊。咱们来具体说说吧……"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3957
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_fb6bf82a:

    # mc "We need to be smart with the budget for this party."
    mc "我们需要在预算上精打细算一下。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3958
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_ac4a3014:

    # mc "About the alcohol... It's for us guys and whoever might show up after our barbecue. We should bring some extra."
    mc "关于酒水的事……这是为我们这些男生，还有之后可能来参加烧烤派对的人准备的。我们得带点额外的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3959
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_e9e3e3da:

    # mc "How much do we have left after our Halloween party?"
    mc "我们万圣节派对之后还剩多少酒？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3961
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_20dc6896:

    # de "Some. Not a lot. We could use it, but many bottles are half-full or less."
    de "有些。不多。我们可以用，但很多瓶子只装了一半甚至更少。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3976
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_503435ae:

    # mc "Let's splurge on some new alcohol, then. It's for showing the DIKs our thanks, after all."
    mc "那我们就大方点，买些新酒吧。毕竟是为了向DIKs兄弟们表达谢意。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3985
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_b6e2783c:

    # mc "Let's use the leftover alcohol and buy as little as possible of what we need on top of it."
    mc "那我们就用剩下的酒，再尽量少买点需要的补上就行。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3990
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_15307bc1:

    # mc "We can save some money here by making people bring what they want to drink."
    mc "我们可以让每个人带自己想喝的酒，这样能省点钱。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3991
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_99a61b82:

    # mc "It's cheap, but we can make up for it."
    mc "虽然便宜，但我们可以弥补。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3995
translate schinese ep10_party_plan_label_b560219d:

    # jm "I wish John Boy could help us with the food."
    jm "真希望John Boy能帮我们准备点吃的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:3997
