    zo "你生日那天？为什么？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5282
translate schinese ep10_zoey_hangout_label_b96d34b6:

    # mc "I don't know why, but that's when I got it."
    mc "我不知道为什么，但就是那时候我得到了它。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5283
translate schinese ep10_zoey_hangout_label_c9a65c87:

    # mc "I believe it's her last diary. Dad told me she wrote a lot."
    mc "我相信这是她的最后一本日记。我爸跟我说她写得很多。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5284
translate schinese ep10_zoey_hangout_label_3e2761e7:

    # mc "And I get to experience her life through it... It's pretty amazing."
    mc "而且我还能通过它体验她的生活……真的很棒。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5287
translate schinese ep10_zoey_hangout_label_644ff8d4:

    # zo "Dude... You're gonna make me cry over here."
    zo "哥们儿...你这让我在这儿都快哭出来了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5292
translate schinese ep10_zoey_hangout_label_50b914e2:

    # mc "You are a softie now."
    mc "你现在可真软了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5294
translate schinese ep10_zoey_hangout_label_f23cdfc9:

    # zo "Haha, shut up! I'm not a softie. But this is your Mom's diary!"
    zo "哈哈，闭嘴！我不是软蛋。但这是你妈的日记！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5297
translate schinese ep10_zoey_hangout_label_dad88747:

    # zo "This is your Mom's diary!"
    zo "这是你妈的日记！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5298
translate schinese ep10_zoey_hangout_label_eec2527f:

    # zo "It's huge!"
    zo "这本子可他妈的大！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5300
translate schinese ep10_zoey_hangout_label_7d3ae8b9:

    # zo "From not knowing a lot about her to having access to her actual fucking outlet..."
    zo "从对她一无所知到现在能接触到她真正的充电口……"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5301
translate schinese ep10_zoey_hangout_label_8b77964d:

    # zo "I know how I treat my notebook; if it's anything like it, this is the best birthday gift you could have gotten."
    zo "我知道我怎么对待我的笔记本；如果它跟我的一样，那这绝对是你能收到的最好的生日礼物。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5302
translate schinese ep10_zoey_hangout_label_363baa1d:

    # mc "That's exactly the way I feel about it. It's a gift that keeps giving..."
    mc "这正是我感觉的。它是个越看越有料的礼物……"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5303
translate schinese ep10_zoey_hangout_label_d554701b:

    # mc "What I do is I read a few pages at a time, and then I put it away for a while."
    mc "我每次只看几页，然后就把它放一边，过段时间再继续。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5305
translate schinese ep10_zoey_hangout_label_980fa92a:

    # mc "I don't wanna rush through it. To me, it feels like she's still filling it with her daily stories."
    mc "我不想急着把它读完。对我来说，感觉她还在往里面填她的日常故事。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5306
translate schinese ep10_zoey_hangout_label_aa71bb4c:

    # mc "Like, I get to read what just happened. And I'm living alongside it."
    mc "比如说，我能看到刚刚发生的事情，我正和它一起生活着。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5307
translate schinese ep10_zoey_hangout_label_8f0ee786:

    # mc "Maybe that doesn't make much sense."
    mc "也许这听起来有点奇怪。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5309
translate schinese ep10_zoey_hangout_label_b9a3e383:

    # zo "Can you read some for me?"
    zo "你能读点给我听吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5311
translate schinese ep10_zoey_hangout_label_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "..."

# episode10\update10.rpy:5313
translate schinese ep10_zoey_hangout_label_156d80af:

    # zo "I totally get it if you don't want to. But I'm dying to find out how she was."
    zo "我完全理解如果你不想读的话。但我想知道她当时到底发生了什么。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5314
translate schinese ep10_zoey_hangout_label_c8e9251c:

    # zo "And I wanna see if there are any uncanny resemblances between you two."
    zo "我还想看看你们俩有没有什么奇怪的相似之处。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5316
translate schinese ep10_zoey_hangout_label_98c0ab59:

    # mc "Ok... I'll read a few pages with you."
    mc "好……我陪你读几页。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5320
translate schinese ep10_zoey_hangout_label_b6191e71:

    # zo "I'm so excited... What's happened until now?"
    zo "我超兴奋的……到目前为止都发生了什么？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5322
translate schinese ep10_zoey_hangout_label_a3ec3a9e:

    # mc "Oh... She's moved to a big place they're turning into a hotel."
    mc "哦……她搬到了一个大地方，他们正把它改造成酒店。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5323
translate schinese ep10_zoey_hangout_label_2e846e52:

    # mc "They are in the midst of renovations and she doesn't like it there one bit, and Dad's working there."
    mc "他们正在翻新，她一点都不喜欢那里，她爸爸也在那儿工作。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5325
translate schinese ep10_zoey_hangout_label_dd367b6e:

    # zo "That's how they met, right?"
    zo "这就是他们认识的方式，对吧？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5327
translate schinese ep10_zoey_hangout_label_d01d6b49:

    # mc "Yeah. And last time I read it, he asked her out on a date, but she kinda turned him down because he's been annoying her with the construction noise."
    mc "对。上次读到时，他约她出去，却被拒绝了，因为施工噪音一直在烦她。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5329
translate schinese ep10_zoey_hangout_label_c7332b80:

    # zo "Hahaha! No way!"
    zo "哈哈哈！不可能！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5332
translate schinese ep10_zoey_hangout_label_1a63e18d:

    # mc "Ok. Here goes..."
    mc "好，开始吧……"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5347
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_9d064d03:

    # ln "Here we go again..."
    ln "又来了..."

# episode10\update10.rpy:5361
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_4c6aa367:

    # ln "Dear diary."
    ln "亲爱的日记。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5362
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_ec7be6f4:

    # ln "They are still doing it."
    ln "他们还在继续。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5365
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_02ab6bd3:

    # ln "Every day. Amazingly, it keeps getting louder and louder."
    ln "每天。真是令人难以置信，声音越来越响了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5367
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_9234c9f2:

    # ln "I'm now at that point where I'm seriously considering changing my sleeping schedule to avoid the daily heart attack-inducing wake-up calls."
    ln "我现在甚至认真考虑改变作息，只为躲开每天这种让人心脏病发作的叫醒方式。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5369
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_5aedca43:

    # ln "And I might have to install a lock in my room, too. This...thing...happened with that annoying guy I wrote about."
    ln "我可能还得在房间里装个锁。这事……又发生了，就是那个烦人的家伙，我之前写过的那个。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5379
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_5274d734:

    # ln "Ahhh..."
    ln "啊啊啊..."

# episode10\update10.rpy:5380
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_9d0a3f65:

    # dad "Oh no."
    dad "哦不。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5382
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_6b0b939f:

    # ln "*{i}Screams{/i}* Ahh!!!"
    ln "*{i}尖叫{/i}啊！！！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5384
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_fffba519:

    # dad "I'm so sorry! I knocked!"
    dad "真的很抱歉！我敲过门了！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5386
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_ed2f5929:

    # ln "You knocked!? Does that permit you to enter my room!?"
    ln "你敲门了？那就有权进我房间了？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5387
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_881b2bef:

    # ln "I wasn't even in here! What the hell is wrong with you!?"
    ln "我根本就没在这儿！你他妈怎么回事！？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5389
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_6d1293eb:

    # dad "I'm so sorry! I'm such an idiot!"
    dad "我真是个蠢蛋！真对不起！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5390
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_1b032937:

    # dad "I just wanted to see you."
    dad "我只是想看看你。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5392
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_ddd64c4e:

    # ln "Yeah, you've seen me, alright!"
    ln "你倒是看到了我，没错啊！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5394
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_856d6775:

    # dad3 "Honey? Are you ok?"
    dad3 "甜心？你没事吧？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5396
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_9d043f86:

    # ln "Oh my God! Hide!"
    ln "天啊！躲起来！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5398
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_7f4f735e:

    # ln "Not there! In the closet! He's coming from that door."
    ln "不在那儿！在衣柜里！他从那扇门过来了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5400
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_72b3c339:

    # dad "You have too much crap in here!"
    dad "你这儿垃圾太多了！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5402
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_9c7837fe:

    # dad3 "What's up with the commotion?"
    dad3 "怎么搞的，这么吵？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5403
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_1ac3af7c:

    # ln "Dad! I'm not decent."
    ln "爸！我还没穿好！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5404
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_a250dc8a:

    # dad3 "I heard yelling."
    dad3 "我听到有人在喊叫。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5407
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_a7b6da86:

    # ln "Oh, that? It was just...you know... Those damn idiot workers!"
    ln "哦，那个？就是那些该死的蠢货！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5408
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_7cdf9402:

    # ln "They are utterly incompetent!"
    ln "他们简直一无是处！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5409
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_e079cd87:

    # ln "They keep waking me up and making all that noise, which gets on my nerves."
    ln "他们老是把我吵醒，还搞出那么多动静，真是烦死我了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5411
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_91ceac67:

    # dad3 "I understand, honey. But you'll have to find a way to tolerate it. This will be our life for the next few months."
    dad3 "我明白，亲爱的。但你得想办法忍一忍。接下来几个月，这就是我们的生活了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5412
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_b586cf8e:

    # dad3 "After the construction crew finishes demolition, it will settle down with the heavy machinery."
    dad3 "施工队完成拆除后，重型机械就会停下来。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5414
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_4ebc5655:

    # dad3 "But you'll have to get used to it being people in here, running about."
    dad3 "但你得习惯这里有人在到处乱跑。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5416
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_3ab99a8b:

    # ln "Oh, they are running about. Like freaking toddlers exploring every nook and cranny!"
    ln "哦，他们到处乱跑。跟该死的小孩似的，到处乱翻乱探。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5418
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_2d0e196b:

    # dad3 "Are they disturbing you in other ways, too? I can have a chat with them."
    dad3 "他们是不是还用其他方式打扰你？我可以跟他们谈谈。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5420
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_c3424f7c:

    # ln "No. I will give them an earful later, believe you me."
    ln "不，我之后会好好教训他们一顿，信我。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5422
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_f2a75e51:

    # dad3 "Get dressed and join your mother for breakfast. I'll be heading out shortly."
    dad3 "穿好衣服，和你妈妈一起吃早饭。我待会儿就出门。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5424
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_51aa0fcb:

    # ln "Yes, Dad."
    ln "嗯，老爸。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5427
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_b85a47b3:

    # dad "You did great."
    dad "你表现得不错。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5431
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_42c47c77:

    # ln "What the hell is wrong with you!?"
    ln "你他妈怎么回事！？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5433
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_84b5678b:

    # dad "I know you want to give me an earful, but he's still within earshot. So..."
    dad "我知道你想好好教训我一顿，但他还在我耳边呢。所以……"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5434
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_bc93bf10:

    # dad "Thanks for covering for me... I don't know why you did that, but I appreciate it."
    dad "谢谢你的掩护……我不知道你为什么这么做，但我很感激。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5436
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_020c6576:

    # ln "Don't flatter yourself."
    ln "别自恋了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5437
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_e2288de4:

    # ln "If I didn't do that, you would be leaving through a hole in the wall like that wrecking ball of yours."
    ln "如果我当时没这么做，你早就像你那台破推土机一样从墙上挖个洞逃走了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5439
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_d05b57a9:

    # ln "And trust me, we have enough ruined walls in our home."
    ln "而且相信我，我们家的墙已经够破的了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5441
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_80cbf184:

    # ln "You could at least have the decency to look at me when I scold you!"
    ln "我训你的时候，你至少该有点礼貌，看着我！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5443
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_c12bb989:

    # dad "I would, but I can still kinda see your tit."
    dad "我本来想的，但我还能看到你的胸部。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5445
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_c35d3f85:

    # ln "*{i}Gasp{/i}* Argh!"
    ln "*{i}吸气{/i}啊！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5446
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_6d140d70:

    # dad "I'll leave and let you put on some clothes."
    dad "我这就离开，让你穿好衣服。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5448
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_d639dd58:

    # ln "Hell no! I'm not done with you. You're not going anywhere until I get some answers."
    ln "想都别想！我还没说完。在回答我的问题之前，你哪儿都别去。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5450
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_9ca2bd5d:

    # ln "Didn't I tell you to look at me!?"
    ln "我没叫你看着我！？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5452
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_10b862ca:

    # dad "Again... I'd do it... But when you pulled your towel up..."
    dad "我又想做了……但你拉起毛巾的时候……"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5454
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_1eff1825:

    # dad "...you kinda exposed your hoo-ha."
    dad "你他妈的差点露馅了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5458
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_51d7aacc:

    # ln "Oh my God!!! Turn around!"
    ln "哦我的天！！转过身来！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5460
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_ddd5e1bb:

    # dad "I wasn't planning on embarrassing you like this, just so that you know."
    dad "我本来没打算让你难堪成这样，你得知道。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5462
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_8a44b261:

    # ln "You certainly have a talent for it!"
    ln "你可真是有天赋啊！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5464
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_e6e25253:

    # dad "I'd compliment you, but I'm afraid it would come off creepy."
    dad "我想夸你几句，但怕听起来太奇怪。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5466
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_82731068:

    # ln "Great, you almost know when to shut your mouth."
    ln "好家伙，你差点知道什么时候该闭嘴了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5468
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_3dc212ba:

    # dad "You have a very fit body."
    dad "你身材真棒。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5470
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_c682f434:

    # ln "Will you shut up!?"
    ln "你他妈闭嘴！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5472
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_6c35b14a:

    # ln "Now, tell me what you're doing in here."
    ln "现在，跟我说说你为什么在这儿。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5474
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_83020bdc:

    # dad "Now? Don't you want to put on more clothes?"
    dad "现在？你不想多穿点衣服吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5476
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_e4fd8b9b:

    # ln "Does it matter? You've already seen me in my full glory. \"Hoo-ha\" and everything."
    ln "有什么区别？我的全貌你都看过了，连下面也一览无余。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5478
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_2724b00f:

    # dad "You're extremely pretty."
    dad "你他妈真他妈漂亮。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5480
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_70f2ec68:

    # ln "FYI, I'm this close to kicking you in the nuts."
    ln "提醒你一下，我差一点就要踢你的蛋蛋了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5482
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_5cac7119:

    # dad "I'm so sorry! This wasn't how it was supposed to go."
    dad "真的很抱歉！事情本来不该变成这样。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5483
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_d90a8a9e:

    # dad "I was coming up here to talk to you. I haven't been able to stop thinking about you since we met downtown."
    dad "我本来是打算上来找你的。从我们在市中心见面之后，我就一直停不下来想你。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5485
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_7f80267c:

    # ln "..."
    ln "..."

# episode10\update10.rpy:5487
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_c1aa45b2:

    # dad "And I wanted to give you this."
    dad "而且我想送给你这个。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5488
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_5d8405ec:

    # dad "It's just a small gift - something to apologize for all the noise we're making."
    dad "这只是一个小小的礼物——用来为咱们制造的所有噪音道个歉。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5490
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_832c57de:

    # ln "What is it?"
    ln "这是什么？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5492
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_5efedd46:

    # dad "Earplugs."
    dad "耳塞。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5494
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_52644cd8:

    # ln "Earplugs?"
    ln "耳塞？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5496
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_8ee697ba:

    # dad "The best earplugs you can find. Trust me, they might not make you completely deaf, but they should help you get your beauty sleep."
    dad "最好的耳塞，绝对管用。相信我，它们可能不会让你完全聋，但至少能帮你睡个好觉。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5497
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_3dffca90:

    # dad "Which, if I might add, you don't need a lot of."
    dad "这玩意儿，如果你听我一句，你不需要很多。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5499
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_1f6f3697:

    # ln "Ugh."
    ln "唔。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5501
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_a84210b6:

    # ln "Earplugs? Is that why you had to enter my room?"
    ln "耳塞？这就是你非要进我房间的原因？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5503
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_1c51649e:

    # dad "The earplugs were the conversation starter. I was going to ask you out on a date, but before I could do that, you showed up naked."
    dad "耳塞成了我们谈话的开端。我本来是想约你出去约会的，但在我能开口之前，你就光着身子出现了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5504
translate schinese ep10_diary_label_2c95c3f2:

    # dad "Haha! Which is, ironically, what a good date would lead to."
