    # isa "I see beginners here often. Granted, some of them don't return after the initial experience, but several do."
    isa "我常看到一些新手来这里。说实话，有些人第一次体验后就不再来了，但也有不少人会坚持下来。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:5783
translate schinese ep10_yoga2_label_1ef9359c:

