    mc "你他妈怎么知道的？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:6597
translate schinese ep10_spar2_label_b5ecea99:

    # dwy "Because I was a punk, I kept looking for trouble."
    dwy "因为我是个混蛋，我一直在找麻烦。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:6602
translate schinese ep10_spar2_label_ad852561:

    # dwy "Hm? That's the first thing you did to impress me today."
