translate schinese ep10_spar2_label_c9551c48:

    # mc "It's not worth getting into a fight over it."
    mc "不值得为这种事打架。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:6612
translate schinese ep10_spar2_label_4b0ef30d:

    # dwy "I wish I had found my calm at your age."
    dwy "我希望在我你这个年纪就能找到那种冷静。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:6613
translate schinese ep10_spar2_label_14b4007a:

    # dwy "I was a punk. I kept looking for trouble."
    dwy "我以前是个混蛋，总爱找麻烦。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:6616
translate schinese ep10_spar2_label_cd501ba8:

    # dwy "Trouble is easy to find when you're the one causing it."
    dwy "麻烦很容易找到，当你自己在制造麻烦的时候。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:6618
translate schinese ep10_spar2_label_e9b52094:

    # mc "I don't get that feeling from talking to you. What changed?"
    mc "我跟你说话时可没这种感觉。你到底变了什么？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:6620
translate schinese ep10_spar2_label_ecf9fb64:

    # dwy "I got sick of it. Friday night used to be fight night."
    dwy "我早就腻了。周五晚上以前都是打架之夜。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:6621
translate schinese ep10_spar2_label_bd7b747e:

    # dwy "Get wasted and either get checked or check someone."
    dwy "喝醉了不是去检查别人就是被别人检查。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:6623
translate schinese ep10_spar2_label_d0c4a521:

    # dwy "Ma hated it. She was all stressed out about it."
    dwy "我妈恨死这事儿了，她为此烦死了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:6624
translate schinese ep10_spar2_label_22ed3cfb:

    # dwy "I woke up one day and realized that the fighting would either get me snuffed or send my Ma to an early grave."
