# episode10\update10.rpy:6625
translate schinese ep10_spar2_label_02da4218:

    # dwy "I had to stop it, but I didn't know how."
    dwy "我得停下，但我不知道该怎么做。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:6627
translate schinese ep10_spar2_label_0c86c512:

    # dwy "But I found myself a girl. Tight ass - *{i}Whistles{/i}* - boy, let me tell you."
    dwy "但我找了个女孩。屁股紧——*{i}口哨声{/i}* - 哥们，我跟你说。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:6628
translate schinese ep10_spar2_label_4ef80637:

    # dwy "And she told me to get my shit together. So, I tried."
    dwy "她让我把事情收拾好。所以我试着去做了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:6630
translate schinese ep10_spar2_label_4c180a4f:

    # dwy "I slipped up here and there. I got back into the pit some weekends but had to pull myself out of it to keep her."
    dwy "我这边也犯过些错，有周末我又混进去了，但为了她，我得控制住自己。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:6631
translate schinese ep10_spar2_label_f2641ddc:

    # dwy "I got myself a job and worked my way up."
    dwy "我找到了一份工作，一步步往上干。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:6632
translate schinese ep10_spar2_label_219c5477:

    # dwy "And lemme tell you something. Real talk, life's better spent not looking over your shoulder every day."
