    de "任何人都能随时打电话或发短信，当我们四处打探时。有了这个通讯系统，你不用摸口袋就能知道是谁发的消息。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9013
translate schinese ep10_science_label_25d8c339:

    # de "Try it with me. Put the button in your pants and press it."
    de "试试看，把按钮塞进裤子，按一下。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9015
translate schinese ep10_science_label_f4d11690:

    # mc "*{i}Sigh{/i}*"
    mc "*{i}叹气{/i}*"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9018
translate schinese ep10_science_label_c1a33265:

    # "*{i}Vibration{/i}*"
    "*{i}震动{/i}*"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9019
translate schinese ep10_science_label_b4871c7b:

    # de "Whoa! That's way too much."
    de "哇！这太夸张了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9022
translate schinese ep10_science_label_a8cb2e9c:

    # te5 "Whose phone is that? Turn it off."
    te5 "谁的手机？关掉。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9025
translate schinese ep10_science_label_6735c55a:

    # de "Turn it off, [mc_de]."
    de "把它关掉，[mc_de]。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9026
translate schinese ep10_science_label_39868813:

    # mc "I'm fucking trying to!"
    mc "我他妈的在努力！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9028
translate schinese ep10_science_label_697b6d3a:

    # te5 "*{i}Cough{/i}*"
    te5 "*{i}咳嗽{/i}*"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9030
translate schinese ep10_science_label_3bda8bc4:

    # mc "It's off. It's off..."
    mc "关了。关了……"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9032
translate schinese ep10_science_label_f214cef5:

    # de "We need to practice on this."
    de "我们需要在这上面练习。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9034
translate schinese ep10_science_label_3281e0f3:

    # mc "The vibration is way too much. There's nothing subtle about it."
    mc "震动太大了，一点都不含蓄。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9036
translate schinese ep10_science_label_7670d9be:

    # de "You can adjust it. Let me set it up for us. Trust me on this."
    de "你可以调校一下。让我来设置好。相信我。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9038
translate schinese ep10_science_label_ed862fd2:

    # mc "Ok..."
    mc "好的..."

# episode10\update10.rpy:9041
translate schinese ep10_science_label_9209f1fc:

    # mc "Are there any other surprises you have planned for me? I want to go in knowing as much as possible beforehand."
    mc "还有别的惊喜打算给我吗？我想在进去之前尽可能多知道一些。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9043
translate schinese ep10_science_label_cc3d44b7:

    # de "There are no more surprises. I swear."
    de "没有其他惊喜了。我发誓。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9045
translate schinese ep10_science_label_0b0ba5e7:

    # de "..."
    de "..."

# episode10\update10.rpy:9047
translate schinese ep10_science_label_c0f99685:

    # de "Um...wait... Maya told you about Mom, right?"
    de "呃……等等……Maya把妈妈的事告诉你了，对吧？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9050
translate schinese ep10_science_label_d3ce4489:

    # mc "Almost. I got the feeling she didn't want to talk about her and that it's a sensitive topic."
    mc "差那么一点点。我感觉她不太想谈她妈妈的事，这话题挺敏感的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9052
translate schinese ep10_science_label_14c94909:

    # de "Yeah... It kinda is."
    de "是啊……确实有点。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9054
translate schinese ep10_science_label_1d4b6594:

    # mc "Nope. What about her?"
    mc "没呢。你妈怎么了？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9056
translate schinese ep10_science_label_dd67d70c:

    # de "There is something you should know."
    de "有件事你得知道。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9057
translate schinese ep10_science_label_bbcbd528:

    # de "Our Mom is chronically ill."
    de "我们妈妈患有慢性疾病。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9059
translate schinese ep10_science_label_3b41274e:

    # mc "Ok? How ill?"
    mc "行？她到底病成什么样了？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9061
translate schinese ep10_science_label_68425ad1:

    # de "It's hard to know for sure. She hasn't worked since we were kids and gets worse with every year."
    de "很难说清楚。她从我们小时候起就不再工作了，而且每年情况都在恶化。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9062
translate schinese ep10_science_label_a7758200:

    # de "It's rough to talk about, but you'd have questions about it after Thanksgiving anyway."
    de "这事儿挺难说的，但感恩节之后你肯定也会问起。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9064
translate schinese ep10_science_label_6de343c0:

    # mc "What's her illness?"
    mc "她得的是什么病？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9066
translate schinese ep10_science_label_e9d2971e:

    # de "Rheumatism. It's a rare case of it, too."
    de "风湿。而且还是罕见的那种。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9068
translate schinese ep10_science_label_b9ac12e3:

    # mc "Is that like arthritis?"
    mc "这是不是像关节炎那样？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9070
translate schinese ep10_science_label_a8bbb188:

    # de "Yeah, and a lot of other stuff that comes with it. It's gotten worse every year since she got her diagnosis."
    de "对，还有许多伴随症状。她确诊以后，情况一年比一年糟。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9071
translate schinese ep10_science_label_cfd9c59b:

    # de "Her immune system is shit. She's at the point where she eats medicine so she can eat her real medicine to avoid side effects."
    de "她的免疫系统烂得不行。现在她吃药只是为了能吃下真正的药，好避免副作用。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9072
translate schinese ep10_science_label_ae268cde:

    # de "It's broken her down completely."
    de "这彻底把她毁了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9074
translate schinese ep10_science_label_1fed6e70:

    # mc "Dude... I'm so sorry to hear that."
    mc "哥们……听到这些我真的很难过。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9076
translate schinese ep10_science_label_bd9181f0:

    # de "It's cool. I can handle it pretty well these days."
    de "这挺好的，我现在应付起来还算可以。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9077
translate schinese ep10_science_label_ece29b32:

    # de "I've thought Mom was going to die every day since I was like five."
    de "我从五岁起就每天都在想妈妈是不是要死了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9079
translate schinese ep10_science_label_ba829831:

    # de "After thinking and worrying about it for that long, it gets easier to handle with every year that passes."
    de "想了很久、担心了很久之后，每年过去一点，处理起来反而容易一点。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9080
translate schinese ep10_science_label_f941a227:

    # de "I mean... You have to be able to handle it and live your life or there's no point."
    de "我是说...你得能应付过来，继续过你的生活，否则就没意义了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9082
translate schinese ep10_science_label_0ab05d0d:

    # mc "I don't know what to say..."
    mc "我不知道该说什么……"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9084
translate schinese ep10_science_label_9094940a:

    # de "I wanted you to know. In case she says something weird or acts inappropriate, it's her dementia."
    de "我想让你知道，以防她说了什么奇怪的话或者做出不合适的行为，那是她的痴呆症。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9086
translate schinese ep10_science_label_7042baa3:

    # mc "Dementia too?"
    mc "痴呆症吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9088
translate schinese ep10_science_label_06420526:

    # de "Vascular dementia, yeah. Like I said, it's bad."
    de "血管性痴呆，对，就像我刚才说的，挺严重的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9091
translate schinese ep10_science_label_12168fd9:

    # mc "Fuck... Poor Maya. I hope I didn't push her too hard on it."
    mc "操...可怜的Maya。希望我没把她逼得太紧。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9093
translate schinese ep10_science_label_18de4e78:

    # de "It's not news to her that Mom's sick. She doesn't cope with it in the same way as I do."
    de "这事儿她早知道了，她妈病了。她处理方式跟我不一样。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9095
translate schinese ep10_science_label_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "..."

# episode10\update10.rpy:9097
translate schinese ep10_science_label_1bdce0fb:

    # de "Boy, we're so not listening to what the Cock professor is yapping about. Am I right?"
    de "伙计，我们根本没在听那个老家伙啰嗦啥。我说对吧？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9099
translate schinese ep10_science_label_1300717d:

    # mc "I've learned to read ahead in advance, knowing that I have to sit next to you in class."
    mc "我早就学会提前预习了，知道得和你坐同一排上课。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9102
translate schinese ep10_science_label_240fd3ee:

    # de "You're such a nerd, [mc_de]."
    de "你可真是个书呆子，[mc_de]。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9112
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_ad90cd43:

    # de "I feel pretty cool in this lab coat."
    de "我穿这身实验服感觉挺酷的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9116
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_d724662b:

    # mc "Yeah, until you wear the safety goggles. Then you don't."
    mc "对，直到你戴上护目镜。戴上以后可就不酷了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9118
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_a831eed7:

    # de "I'm not gonna wear those."
    de "我可不戴那些。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9120
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_bdfa5d07:

    # eu "Actually, goggles aren't optional. Safety comes first!"
    eu "其实护目镜是必须的。安全第一！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9122
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_c74de115:

    # de "You're not my teacher."
    de "你不是我的老师。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9124
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_494b57a1:

    # eu "While that is true, I have taken several scientific classes and become quite experienced with lab work."
    eu "虽然你说得对，但我上过不少科学课，对实验室操作已经很熟悉了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9125
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_bc0fce10:

    # eu "Goggles are always mandatory. If you get acid in your eyes, then what will you do?"
    eu "护目镜是必须的。如果你眼睛进了酸液，那你该怎么办？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9127
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_226a7544:

    # de "Yeah, yeah. Go away."
    de "嗯，嗯。滚开。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9129
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_54bdd2ba:

    # eu "By the way, the answer to that question is to use the emergency eyewash station."
    eu "顺便说一句，那个问题的答案是使用紧急洗眼站。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9131
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_e4c28e3f:

    # de "[mc_de_up]. Look! They have a shower in here."
    de "[mc_de_up]看！他们这里有个淋浴间。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9132
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_1d511e8e:

    # mc "Don't do anything stupid with it."
    mc "别拿那个东西搞什么花样。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9140
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_101b9303:

    # no "No... No."
    no "不...不。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9142
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_476ebbf5:

    # mc "Nora?"
    mc "Nora？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9144
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_9d83a8e2:

    # mc "What are you doing here?"
    mc "你在这儿干嘛？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9147
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_9a59b3d2:

    # no "Why haven't you told me that you are a student?"
    no "你为什么不告诉我你是学生？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9149
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_31189055:

    # no "Are you a student here?"
    no "你是这所学校的学生吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9152
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_324c57fc:

    # mc "Haven't I? Uh... I thought I did. Wait... Are you a teacher?"
    mc "我是不是说过？呃……我本来以为我跟你说过。等等……你是老师吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9154
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_dfd67529:

    # mc "Yeah. What the hell! Are you my teacher?"
    mc "对。搞什么鬼！你是我老师吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9156
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_d504baaf:

    # no "I'm not a teacher, per se. I'm a scientist and this is just a minor part of my salary."
    no "我不是老师，说白了。我是科学家，这只是我薪水的一小部分。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9158
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_2eb18d0b:

    # mc "But you're teaching this class, no?"
    mc "但你是在教这门课，对吧？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9160
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_ea584bf6:

    # no "Yes. And I surely didn't expect to see you here."
    no "是的。我可没料到会在这里见到你。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9161
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_0980ba26:

    # no "You have to promise not to tell anyone about us. It would look bad."
    no "你得保证不把这事告诉任何人。那会很丢脸。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9164
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_84782df1:

    # mc "Maybe you would look bad, but me? Not so much."
    mc "也许你看起来会不太好，但我不太会。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9166
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_9fc0f557:

    # mc "Bad time for that joke..."
    mc "这笑话选得真不是时候..."

# episode10\update10.rpy:9168
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_99304de3:

    # mc "Yeah, totally."
    mc "嗯，当然了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9170
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_84ceb0d0:

    # no "Get in there. Class is about to begin."
    no "进去吧。课要开始了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9172
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_6aac9c73:

    # no "(Damn it! Stay calm. Stay professional and think about this later.)"
    no "（该死！保持冷静。保持专业，等会再想这件事。）"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9177
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_0e438712:

    # no "You've got to be kidding me."
    no "你他妈是认真的吗。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9180
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_b1deaa3c:

    # mc "Nora..."
    mc "Nora..."

# episode10\update10.rpy:9182
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_73288010:

    # mc "Oh, wait... We chatted on Swyper, didn't we?"
    mc "哦，等等……我们不是在Swyper上聊过吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9184
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_6ddc91a0:

    # no "I believe I have dodged a bullet with you."
    no "我相信我这次算是逃过一劫了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9185
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_d3dbf357:

    # no "Are you a student?"
    no "你是学生吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9187
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_28218e58:

    # mc "Yeah. Didn't I tell you that?"
    mc "对啊。我之前不是跟你说过吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9189
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_c31d7903:

    # no "You most definitely did not."
    no "你绝对是的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9191
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_823b0262:

    # mc "And you... You're a teacher?"
    mc "你是个老师？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9193
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_586a36b2:

    # no "It's not my primary profession. It's more of a work task I do as a part of my salary."
    no "这不是我的主业。这只是我拿薪水做的一份兼职工作。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9195
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_a7bcf340:

    # mc "I see..."
    mc "我明白了..."

# episode10\update10.rpy:9198
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_16c6b01e:

    # no "If you'll excuse me, I will now pretend as if I never squatted in front of you."
    no "如果可以的话，我现在就假装我从未在你面前蹲过。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9200
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_26b85895:

    # no "If you'll excuse me, I will now pretend I never swiped up on you."
    no "如果可以的话，我现在就假装我从来没对你动过心思。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9202
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_c5da85e7:

    # no "Good afternoon, everybody. We'll begin shortly."
    no "下午好，大家。我们很快就开始。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9205
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_c5da85e7_1:

    # no "Good afternoon, everybody. We'll begin shortly."
    no "下午好，大家。我们马上开始。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9209
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_1d31d2a3:

    # de "Whoa!"
    de "哇！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9210
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_177d3eb2:

    # mc "What are you doing?"
    mc "你在干什么？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9212
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_38607cdd:

    # no "Release that handle!"
    no "放开那个把手！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9215
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_e9c27734:

    # de "The shower works."
    de "淋浴间能用。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9217
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_2c7d9e6a:

    # no "This is not how I wanted to introduce myself to you today, but if you touch things you're not supposed to touch in here, you will be asked to leave."
    no "这可不是我今天想用这种方式介绍自己的，但如果你碰了这里不该碰的东西，那你也会被请出去。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9219
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_829d804b:

    # no "That goes for you, too."
    no "这句也适用于你。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9221
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_2ff74e70:

    # mc "I didn't do anything."
    mc "我没做什么。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9223
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_2d1db440:

    # no "You two are working together. That's your punishment."
    no "你们两个一起工作。这就是你们的惩罚。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9225
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_8c2b4f36:

    # de "Haha, what a sucker. That's not punishment at all."
    de "哈哈哈，真是个傻瓜。那根本不算惩罚。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9228
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_4a3a99db:

    # de "Ouch!"
    de "哎哟！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9230
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_fe00467f:

    # de "[mc_de_up]..."
    de "[mc_de_up]..."

# episode10\update10.rpy:9231
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_177fc7ba:

    # de "Lab partners!"
    de "实验室搭档！"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9233
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_8b563015:

    # no "Welcome to the practical part of the course. I'm Dr. Nora Jenkins and I will be your supervisor."
    no "欢迎进入这门课的实践环节。我是Nora·詹金斯博士，将担任你们的指导老师。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9234
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_b2324aa9:

    # no "I see a couple of familiar faces here from other courses. Most of what I say won't surprise you, but you'll have to bear with me for the sake of everyone else who's here for the first time."
    no "我看到这里有几个来自其他课程的熟面孔。我接下来要说的大部分内容你们可能已经听过，但为了那些第一次来的新同学，你们得忍耐一下。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9236
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_ab841289:

    # no "We will learn how to work professionally in a laboratory environment during our sessions."
    no "我们将通过课程学习如何在实验室环境中专业地进行工作。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9237
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_a2b471cd:

    # no "That includes using the lab equipment correctly and learning to measure, weigh, mix and assess chemicals properly."
    no "这包括正确使用实验设备，学会准确测量、称重、混合和评估化学品。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9239
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_578efb44:

    # no "You will be working with hazardous chemicals and must read the risk assessments before you're allowed to begin work."
    no "你们将要处理危险化学品，必须在开始工作前先阅读风险评估。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9240
translate schinese ep10_lab_label_71cc7a02:

    # no "Keep lab coats and safety goggles on at all times during class. Wear gloves when you need them."
    no "全程保持实验服和护目镜穿戴。需要时请佩戴手套。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:9242
