    # doc2 "When did you first notice this change?"
    doc2 "你什么时候注意到她变了？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10129
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_af42583e:

    # sb "I guess...the first time was...um..."
    sb "我想...第一次是...嗯..."

# episode10\update10.rpy:10130
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_410f3d1e:

    # sb "Yeah. Around the time I started my job."
    sb "嗯，大概就是我开始工作那会儿。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10132
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_169bded3:

    # doc2 "The one you just discontinued?"
    doc2 "你刚停用的那个？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10134
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_920469a8:

    # sb "Yes. Around eight years ago."
    sb "是的。大约八年前。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10135
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_3693852f:

    # sb "I worked a lot. I stayed at the office late, even after the market had closed."
    sb "我工作很忙，经常留在办公室，甚至市场收盘后也还在那儿。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10137
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_5e36a201:

    # sb "I made my analyses and procured contacts... I did everything I could to stay in front of the pack."
    sb "我做分析、拓展人脉……竭尽全力保持领先。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10138
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_8812d634:

    # sb "As a result, we stopped talking because there was little time of the day left for it."
    sb "因此，我们渐渐没话可说了，因为一天剩下的时间已经不多了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10140
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_a680babb:

    # sb "And this was also around the time when we found out that my wife..."
    sb "这也是我们得知我妻子……的时候。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10141
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_8f493220:

    # sb "That she was barren."
    sb "她不能生育。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10143
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_0e0d02fb:

    # doc2 "That must have been hard for you two, Stephen."
    doc2 "这对你们俩一定很难吧，Stephen。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10145
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_c23aeaa5:

    # sb "It didn't make things easier for us."
    sb "这并没有让我们的事变得容易。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10146
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_96b3e126:

    # sb "She decided to go for a Ph.D. instead of having kids..."
    sb "她决定去读博士，而不是生孩子……"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10148
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_fee43830:

    # sb "Something that felt smart to do, but she was just using it as a distraction from that horrible news."
    sb "一件当时看起来很聪明的事，但她只是用它来逃避那个可怕的消息。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10149
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_64f4dc69:

    # sb "Halfway into her doctoral studies, we decided to adopt. She couldn't let go of her desire to be a mother."
    sb "在她读到博士一半的时候，我们决定领养。她放不下当母亲的渴望。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10151
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_60b2cbab:

    # sb "It was...not the best choice. But how could I deny her that wish? First being barren and then having a husband tell her she can't adopt."
    sb "那确实不是个好选择。但我又怎么能拒绝她这个愿望呢？先是不育，然后丈夫还告诉她不能领养。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10153
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_bda8d9f9:

    # doc2 "When you say it wasn't the best choice, can you elaborate on that?"
    doc2 "你说这不是最好的选择，能具体说说吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10155
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_abf61153:

    # sb "I was too preoccupied with work and she was in the middle of writing her thesis. Neither of us had the time for it. It didn't make sense to have kids."
    sb "我当时太忙工作，她又在写论文，我们都没时间。生孩子根本不现实。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10156
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_5f0e252c:

    # sb "Sure, because of me, we had the money... But those kids..."
    sb "当然，因为是我，我们才有那笔钱……但那些孩子……"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10158
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_dc4e86bf:

    # sb "*{i}Sigh{/i}*"
    sb "*{i}叹气{/i}*"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10159
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_b9f24db8:

    # sb "They were already damaged. They were old enough to have bad memories, for Christ's sake."
    sb "他们已经伤痕累累。他们年纪足够大，能记住不好的事了，该死的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10160
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_7b19e119:

    # sb "I failed to see how we could make that work. I don't have the tools for that."
    sb "我没看出来我们怎么能把这事搞成。我根本没有那种能力。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10162
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_1b76d91b:

    # sb "You don't grow to be a father to kids like that overnight."
    sb "你不可能一夜之间就变成那种父亲。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10163
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_6ed5845d:

    # sb "And why did we have to get both of them?"
    sb "为什么我们非得收养两个？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10165
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_d6968be5:

    # doc2 "What did you tell your wife? Did you voice your concerns and thoughts?"
    doc2 "你跟妻子说了什么？你有没有表达过你的顾虑和想法？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10167
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_53ade79a:

    # sb "I tried, but she wouldn't hear me out. Early on in our relationship, we talked about having kids in the future."
    sb "我试过，但她根本听不进去。我们刚开始交往的时候，就聊过将来要孩子的事。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10168
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_6de9b12a:

    # sb "She remembered me saying I wanted a son if I ever had kids. It was just a hypothetical answer for me."
    sb "她记得我曾经说过，如果我有孩子，我希望是个儿子。那只是我当时随口说的一个假设性答案。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10169
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_327e3266:

    # sb "And she... She told me she wanted to have a daughter."
    sb "她……她告诉我她想要个女儿。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10170
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_80990aad:

    # sb "Adopting both was her way to fulfill that as if it was a dream we shared."
    sb "收养两个孩子是她实现那个愿望的方式，仿佛这是我们共同的梦想。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10172
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_3061eda7:

    # sb "It was such a mistake. I've never felt like a father to those kids. I try my best and they call me \"Dad\", but..."
    sb "这真是个错误。我从来没觉得自己是他们的父亲。我尽力了，他们叫我“爸爸”，但……"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10173
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_fab0928f:

    # sb "I don't feel like I'm their father. I don't feel connected to them... I try my best, but..."
    sb "我感觉不到自己是他们的父亲。我跟他们之间好像没什么连接……我尽力了，但……"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10175
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_51c81062:

    # sb "I'm raising someone else's kids. That's all I'm thinking."
    sb "我只能养别人的孩子。这就是我脑子里唯一的事。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10176
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_bccfd21c:

    # sb "They deserve better than me, but this is as good as they can get."
    sb "他们值得比我更好的人，但这就是他们能得到的最好了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10178
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_3296db4d:

    # sb "And now I got fired... My wife won't talk to me... She rarely sleeps with me..."
    sb "现在我被开除了……我老婆也不跟我说话了……她很少跟我睡觉……"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10179
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_a67a2321:

    # sb "I don't feel like a man when I'm with her anymore. I feel like I'm living someone else's life."
    sb "和她在一起时，我感觉自己像个陌生人。我感觉自己在过别人的人生。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10181
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_f17d5253:

    # doc2 "May I suggest couples therapy? It's a great way to communicate with your wife."
    doc2 "我建议你们试试夫妻治疗，这是和你妻子沟通的好方法。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10182
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_17e8aa91:

    # doc2 "You obviously have things to tell her. And every relationship needs maintenance and communication is the tool for it."
    doc2 "你明显有想跟她说的话。每段关系都需要维护，而沟通就是最好的工具。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10184
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_875d3ba6:

    # sb "That's not going to happen. I've tried talking to her. And it either ends with her getting mad at me or her shutting down the conversation before it takes off."
    sb "那可不行。我试过跟她沟通，结果不是她对我发火，就是她在我还没说几句的时候就冷着脸把话题掐死了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10185
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_b2d4e80b:

    # sb "And she also has the guts to tell me that I'm not listening! It's nuts..."
    sb "她还敢跟我说我根本没在听！这他妈也太疯了..."

# episode10\update10.rpy:10186
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_f11b2216:

    # sb "The only way that works for us is to ignore all the bad feelings and live life like nothing's wrong."
    sb "我们唯一能维持下去的办法，就是假装什么都没发生，把那些不愉快都给忽略掉。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10188
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_05fdcdeb:

    # doc2 "That's not a sustainable lifestyle, Stephen."
    doc2 "这可不是个能长久维持的生活方式，Stephen。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10190
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_dc4e86bf_1:

    # sb "*{i}Sigh{/i}*"
    sb "*{i}叹气{/i}*"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10191
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_068dd795:

    # sb "Saying what I say to you within these four walls... If she knew about it, it would break her."
    sb "说这些话只在我们这四面墙内...要是她知道了，她会受不了的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10192
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_e587762e:

    # sb "If my kids ever knew what I felt, it would fuck them up even further - likely beyond repair."
    sb "如果我的孩子知道我内心真实的想法，恐怕会把他们搞垮，可能连修复的可能都没有。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10194
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_c8d8693c:

    # doc2 "And not saying what you feel to your wife... Do you think it doesn't wear you down?"
    doc2 "不说出你内心的感受给妻子听……你有没有想过，这不会让你心力交瘁吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10196
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_fc639c45:

    # sb "I never talked to my parents like this. I've been raised to be strong and not to talk about my feelings."
    sb "我从来没跟父母这样说过话。我从小就被教育要坚强，不能表露自己的情绪。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10198
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_fd17ff55:

    # doc2 "It's not a weakness to talk about your feelings. After all, you've been strong enough to admit you need my help."
    doc2 "这不意味着软弱，你有勇气来找我帮忙，就已经证明了你的坚强。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10200
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_601adee1:

    # sb "I needed someone to listen to me. Just for once..."
    sb "我需要有人听我说说话。就一次……"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10202
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_dc0a95ca:

    # doc2 "How about if we change the subject for now?"
    doc2 "那我们换个话题吧？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10204
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_6d4ccbdf:

    # sb "Yes, please."
    sb "好的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10206
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_34e2e2a6:

    # doc2 "Let's return to your work situation. What are your thoughts?"
    doc2 "我们回到你的工作情况。你有什么想法？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10208
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_d543ed06:

    # sb "My thoughts? Um...let's see..."
    sb "我的想法？嗯……让我想想……"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10209
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_c57a1e54:

    # sb "How about my boss firing me for not breaking laws for him? That's a fun thought."
    sb "那我老板因为我没帮他违法而开除我？这想法挺有趣的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10212
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_598ab51f:

    # sb "Or how about me putting in eight years for that company and it's gone *{i}Snaps fingers{/i}* like that?"
    sb "或者我为那家公司干了八年，结果它就没了*{i}打响指{/i}像那样？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10214
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_5495c770:

    # doc2 "That doesn't sound legal."
    doc2 "这听起来不合法。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10216
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_53fa3438:

    # sb "Well, neither is doing blow together at meetings. I'm not looking to go down the road for mutual destruction, thanks."
    sb "那两个家伙在会议上一起吸毒也不太好。我可不想走互相毁灭的路，谢谢。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10217
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_38f492f7:

    # sb "Guess from now on, I'll have to become a stay-at-home dad."
    sb "从现在开始，我得当个全职爸爸了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10219
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_d5605d70:

    # doc2 "You can take some time to reflect. Maybe there is something else in life that you've always wanted to pursue. A change of vocation, perhaps?"
    doc2 "你可以花点时间好好想想。也许生活中还有其他你一直想尝试的事情。换个职业，说不定？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10221
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_aa44c3c8:

    # sb "I'm sure as shit not going back to investment banking, I can tell you that much."
    sb "我他妈的肯定不会回去做投资银行了，这点我可以告诉你。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10222
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_2f38cd3f:

    # sb "Maybe I'll sit on my ass all day doing nothing for a change."
    sb "也许我这次可以整天瘫在椅子上啥也不干，换换口味。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10224
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_1b333d4f:

    # doc2 "Do you think you'd feel fulfilled that way?"
    doc2 "你觉得这样就能感到满足吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10226
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_35737378:

    # sb "Fulfilled? Who the hell feels fulfilled?"
    sb "满足？谁他妈会觉得自己满足？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10227
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_5f001098:

    # sb "I've got enough money to last lifetimes. It doesn't make me feel fulfilled."
    sb "我手头的钱够花一辈子。可它他妈的，一点都填不满我内心的空洞。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10229
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_ec0ef2e7:

    # sb "Do you want to know what it does to me?"
    sb "你想知道它对我有什么影响吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10230
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_a1c082fe:

    # sb "It makes me realize that there is a void that normal people can fill with the stress of work and the struggle of providing for their families and trying to get rich."
    sb "它让我意识到，普通人靠工作的压力和养家糊口的挣扎，才能填满生命中的空虚。而我什么都没有了，什么也不用证明了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10231
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_75b4b63c:

    # sb "And when you get rich, that stress and struggle disappear... Revealing the true emptiness of life. It's like all there is to life is the chase to make it."
    sb "当你变得有钱了，那种压力和挣扎就消失了……暴露出生命真正的空虚。就像人生不过就是一场追逐成功的竞赛。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10233
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_79e9ae60:

    # sb "I don't have anything left to accomplish - nothing left to prove."
    sb "我没啥可证明的了——什么目标都达不到了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10234
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_4cf7620a:

    # sb "And thinking about this... These thoughts scare the fuck out of me. And a normal person could never relate to them."
    sb "想到这些……这些想法把我吓得半死。普通人都根本无法理解这种感受。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10235
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_b210dc38:

    # sb "They'd call it rich privilege and belittle it because they have this fairytale fantasy of how good it is to be wealthy."
    sb "他们会把这称为富人特权并加以贬低，因为他们幻想富裕生活像童话一样美好。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10237
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_598e3051:

    # doc2 "You can always set new goals for yourself, Stephen. Personal goals don't have to revolve around money."
    doc2 "你可以给自己设定新的目标，Stephen。个人目标不一定要围绕着钱来转。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10239
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_a2d47d02:

    # doc2 "Perhaps you'll think of something. That's all I have time for today, but I want you to come here again soon so we can explore this further."
    doc2 "也许你能想出点什么。今天就到这儿了，但希望你尽快再来，我们继续深入探讨这个话题。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10245
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_41041794:

    # ja "What the hell is this?"
    ja "这他妈是什么鬼？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10248
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_f1779abe:

    # sb "Divorce papers. It's been long overdue."
    sb "离婚协议。早就该办了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10250
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_8c34f5ca:

    # ja "We are NOT getting a divorce."
    ja "我们不会离婚。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10252
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_f8db4f23:

    # sb "I thought you'd be happier about this."
    sb "我以为你会为这事开心点。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10253
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_402f8f68:

    # sb "You've been threatening me with one for long enough. I'm granting you that wish."
    sb "你威胁我这么久，现在终于轮到你了。我成全你。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10254
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_5b019621:

    # sb "The truth is we should have broken up many years ago. We've been living a lie and now it's time."
    sb "事实是，我们早就该分手了。我们一直活在谎言里，现在该结束了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10256
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_9e3f4957:

    # ja "Oh, really!? It's time all of a sudden!?"
    ja "哦，真的啊？突然就到时间了？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10257
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_763e63c4:

    # ja "You've been cheating on me for God knows how long and now it's finally time!?"
    ja "你一直在我身上搞婚外情，搞了这么久，现在终于该结束了！？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10259
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_01894816:

    # ja "What about your children? What about our family?"
    ja "你还有孩子，还有我们的家庭？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10260
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_579dda1a:

    # ja "Do you realize how this will affect them and our reputation?"
    ja "你明白这会对我们和他们声誉造成什么影响吗？"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10262
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_1a7834e7:

    # sb "This isn't a spur-of-the-moment decision, Jade."
    sb "这可不是一时冲动的决定，Jade。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10263
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_ec54326b:

    # sb "I've thought about this for a long time - years, actually. But you don't want to hear what I think or feel. You never listen."
    sb "我早就想过这件事——其实已经好几年了。但你根本不想听我脑子里在想什么，也不想了解我的感受。你从来都不愿意听。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10264
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_1b821dde:

    # sb "I can't walk through the rest of my life living like this. I need changes. I need peace of mind."
    sb "我再也受不了这样过下去了。我需要改变，我需要内心的平静。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10265
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_91ec701f:

    # sb "When I look into the mirror, I don't see the man I used to be."
    sb "当我照镜子的时候，我看到的已经不是曾经那个我了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10267
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_278a2920:

    # ja "This screams life crisis, Stephen. It's pathetic. You've grown old, put on a few pounds and lost some hair - it happens to everyone."
    ja "这分明是中年危机，Stephen。太可悲了。年纪大了、胖了几斤、掉了些头发——人人都会经历。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10268
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_0f44f70e:

    # ja "You don't make these rash decisions without thinking them through."
    ja "你这种决定可不是一时冲动就能做出的。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10270
translate schinese ep10_sb2_label_ca4e2c54:

    # sb "I have thought it through."
    sb "我好好想过了。"

# episode10\update10.rpy:10271
